(6774165, 1015870, 113156, '<td valign="top">I like the processing here, very AA.</td>', 'I like the processing here, very AA.', '2012-05-21 05:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774172, 1016309, 145329, '<td valign="top">amazing, i took some shots just like this on saturday just gone.</td>', 'amazing, i took some shots just like this on saturday just gone.', '2012-05-21 05:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774173, 1016465, 145329, '<td valign="top">very ansel</td>', 'very ansel', '2012-05-21 05:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774174, 1016222, 145329, '<td valign="top">bit flat for ansel no?</td>', 'bit flat for ansel no?', '2012-05-21 05:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774175, 1016125, 145329, '<td valign="top">very ansel indeed.</td>', 'very ansel indeed.', '2012-05-21 05:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774180, 1016526, 54446, '<td valign="top">A good scene.  I find my eyes searching the shore for a subject.  On my monitor, the reflection in the water is quite bright, which seems a bit unnatural.  The clouds above the tree line are plain.  The trees and leaves are detailed and appear to be in focus, but seem to clutter.  I do like your effort at controling detail in the shadows.</td>', 'A good scene.  I find my eyes searching the shore for a subject.  On my monitor, the reflection in the water is quite bright, which seems a bit unnatural.  The clouds above the tree line are plain.  The trees and leaves are detailed and appear to be in focus, but seem to clutter.  I do like your effort at controling detail in the shadows.', '2012-05-21 06:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774185, 1015569, 54446, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and abstract.  Maybe more coarse grain than AA would use.  For a subject like this, I also think AA would go for clarity and sharpness.  I do like the range of tones, with few blown out highlights and few blocked up shadows.</td>', 'Mysterious and abstract.  Maybe more coarse grain than AA would use.  For a subject like this, I also think AA would go for clarity and sharpness.  I do like the range of tones, with few blown out highlights and few blocked up shadows.', '2012-05-21 06:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774187, 1015985, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like this scene.  AA did do some architectural photography.  Rich tones, nice clarity, superb DOF.  My constructive criticism is the absence of perspective correction.  AA would use his tilt-shift capability of the large format bellows box camera to square away the vertical lines.  I really like your control of detail in shadows.</td>', 'I like this scene.  AA did do some architectural photography.  Rich tones, nice clarity, superb DOF.  My constructive criticism is the absence of perspective correction.  AA would use his tilt-shift capability of the large format bellows box camera to square away the vertical lines.  I really like your control of detail in shadows.', '2012-05-21 06:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774189, 1015796, 54446, '<td valign="top">A good bird pose.  The sky appears to be one tone.  Might have looked more natural with a smooth or natural gradient.  I might have composed the scene differently, with bird and stump less center middle. Overall, the light is pretty harsh and coming from directly overhead.  Detail is good, but seems stressed by the postprocessing.</td>', 'A good bird pose.  The sky appears to be one tone.  Might have looked more natural with a smooth or natural gradient.  I might have composed the scene differently, with bird and stump less center middle. Overall, the light is pretty harsh and coming from directly overhead.  Detail is good, but seems stressed by the postprocessing.', '2012-05-21 06:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774197, 1016348, 54446, '<td valign="top">The road and fence provide good leading lines into the fine landscape.  The shot angle to the sun is acute.  The dynamic range of the scene is such that detail will be lost in the shadows, as many objects will go to silhouette.  Detail lost in the bright sky also.  That high contrast can be effective, as it is with your foreground tree, but might have been anathema to AA.  Your tonal range is very wide.</td>', 'The road and fence provide good leading lines into the fine landscape.  The shot angle to the sun is acute.  The dynamic range of the scene is such that detail will be lost in the shadows, as many objects will go to silhouette.  Detail lost in the bright sky also.  That high contrast can be effective, as it is with your foreground tree, but might have been anathema to AA.  Your tonal range is very wide.', '2012-05-21 06:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774201, 1016505, 54446, '<td valign="top">I see how you''ve retained some detail in the darkest shadows.  I see elements in the scene which might have been chosen by AA to be the subject of the scene, but, for example, you''re too far away from those craggy trees on the point, or in the water just off the point.  Those could have been shapes of interest, with the water and hillside supporting the composition.  As is, the scene needs a focal point.  It''s sort of there with the point of land and the far shore.  My eyes go there and I find myself wishing to be closer.</td>', 'I see how you''ve retained some detail in the darkest shadows.  I see elements in the scene which might have been chosen by AA to be the subject of the scene, but, for example, you''re too far away from those craggy trees on the point, or in the water just off the point.  Those could have been shapes of interest, with the water and hillside supporting the composition.  As is, the scene needs a focal point.  It''s sort of there with the point of land and the far shore.  My eyes go there and I find myself wishing to be closer.', '2012-05-21 06:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774205, 1016087, 54446, '<td valign="top">Shooting from inside to the bright outside is a unique take on AA style.  The 10 camera stop dynamic range of that situation would have been frustrating to efforts to dodge and burn away in the darkroom.  To my eyes, there is good sharpness and detail in the sculpted wood and burlap window treatment.  But, the clarity and sharpness fall off in the window panes and frame, indicating a too shallow DOF.   I do find detail in the darkest shadows.</td>', 'Shooting from inside to the bright outside is a unique take on AA style.  The 10 camera stop dynamic range of that situation would have been frustrating to efforts to dodge and burn away in the darkroom.  To my eyes, there is good sharpness and detail in the sculpted wood and burlap window treatment.  But, the clarity and sharpness fall off in the window panes and frame, indicating a too shallow DOF.   I do find detail in the darkest shadows.', '2012-05-21 07:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774207, 1016496, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting, good sky.  Detail is lost in the bright areas on the water.  The driftwood stump seems a bit awkwardly placed in the scene.  It blocks, rather than complements the view.  While I''m sure you wanted to  include as much sky as possible, the vertical orientation (with frame added, besides) seems an awkward choice.  I do like the good detail in the foreground sand/mud.</td>', 'Interesting, good sky.  Detail is lost in the bright areas on the water.  The driftwood stump seems a bit awkwardly placed in the scene.  It blocks, rather than complements the view.  While I''m sure you wanted to  include as much sky as possible, the vertical orientation (with frame added, besides) seems an awkward choice.  I do like the good detail in the foreground sand/mud.', '2012-05-21 07:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774208, 1016421, 54446, '<td valign="top">Geologically interesting subject.  Good detail retained in the shadows.  High contrast time of day, but pretty good control of highlights.  The sky doesn''t seem right, but the cloud detail adds interest.  Might be some pp artifacts in the sky.  The strength of the image is the detail in the stone and the story it tells.</td>', 'Geologically interesting subject.  Good detail retained in the shadows.  High contrast time of day, but pretty good control of highlights.  The sky doesn''t seem right, but the cloud detail adds interest.  Might be some pp artifacts in the sky.  The strength of the image is the detail in the stone and the story it tells.', '2012-05-21 07:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774212, 1016222, 54446, '<td valign="top">An interesting architectural study.  The perspective would have been corrected with AA''s tilt-shift bellows lenses on his box camera.  This image has not enough dynamic range, nor dynamic light.  In an effort to control the highlights and shadows, the scene seems flat in contrast to me.  I love the detail in the sky.</td>', 'An interesting architectural study.  The perspective would have been corrected with AA''s tilt-shift bellows lenses on his box camera.  This image has not enough dynamic range, nor dynamic light.  In an effort to control the highlights and shadows, the scene seems flat in contrast to me.  I love the detail in the sky.', '2012-05-21 07:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774214, 1016411, 54446, '<td valign="top">A scene with good potential.  Seems to be harsh light.  I think it''s possibly a notch short on sharpness.  Almost looks like a 0.3s handheld shot.  I apologize if you did, indeed, use a tripod.    Just has that slight camera shake look.  I see the effort to control detail in the shadows.</td>', 'A scene with good potential.  Seems to be harsh light.  I think it''s possibly a notch short on sharpness.  Almost looks like a 0.3s handheld shot.  I apologize if you did, indeed, use a tripod.    Just has that slight camera shake look.  I see the effort to control detail in the shadows.', '2012-05-21 07:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774218, 1015789, 54446, '<td valign="top">There is subtle elegance in the tones of the tidal waters.  It is peaceful and interesting.  Part of the sky is super interesting.... part is milky white.  I do like the placement of the horizon line on the upper thirds area.  The strength of the scene is the inclusion of foreground shore... giving the entire scene a three dimensional effect.</td>', 'There is subtle elegance in the tones of the tidal waters.  It is peaceful and interesting.  Part of the sky is super interesting.... part is milky white.  I do like the placement of the horizon line on the upper thirds area.  The strength of the scene is the inclusion of foreground shore... giving the entire scene a three dimensional effect.', '2012-05-21 07:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774224, 1016565, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good use of thirds here.  Absolutely love the interesting, detailed clouds and very natural sky gradient.  While the foot path provides a leading line into the scene, I think it may be a net negative because it cuts up the foreground meadow.  The forested hills are interesting.  Rich tonal range.  Don''t know if you used color channels for your BW conversion, or not.  If not, then that might have been a method to transform this nice scene into an even better monochrome.</td>', 'Good use of thirds here.  Absolutely love the interesting, detailed clouds and very natural sky gradient.  While the foot path provides a leading line into the scene, I think it may be a net negative because it cuts up the foreground meadow.  The forested hills are interesting.  Rich tonal range.  Don''t know if you used color channels for your BW conversion, or not.  If not, then that might have been a method to transform this nice scene into an even better monochrome.', '2012-05-21 07:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774232, 1016543, 54446, '<td valign="top">Could be a poster for the Sierra Club.  The iconic barbed wire fence and the new age wind turbine are controversial.  Threats to the wilderness.  So, I like your subject choice very much.  Pretty harsh light situation causing lots of silhouettes.  Not a bad thing in this case, because the icons of controversy are well presented.  I like your ground level pov.  The vegetation adds a lot to this scene.  The sky is pretty good with nice coud detail.</td>', 'Could be a poster for the Sierra Club.  The iconic barbed wire fence and the new age wind turbine are controversial.  Threats to the wilderness.  So, I like your subject choice very much.  Pretty harsh light situation causing lots of silhouettes.  Not a bad thing in this case, because the icons of controversy are well presented.  I like your ground level pov.  The vegetation adds a lot to this scene.  The sky is pretty good with nice coud detail.', '2012-05-21 07:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774259, 1016245, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image. Great tones and highlights.</td>', 'Outstanding image. Great tones and highlights.', '2012-05-21 09:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774261, 1016567, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, I particularly like the leading lines. Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful image, I particularly like the leading lines. Nice work.', '2012-05-21 09:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774262, 1015546, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am mad for this.  Perfect wide angle focus and depth of shadows and light. (  I would have cropped that that wisp of a cloud, but it''s hardly worth mentioning. )</td>', 'I am mad for this.  Perfect wide angle focus and depth of shadows and light. (  I would have cropped that that wisp of a cloud, but it''s hardly worth mentioning. )', '2012-05-21 09:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774263, 1016300, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Love the rays of light.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Love the rays of light.', '2012-05-21 09:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774264, 1016454, 10848, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, nice texture, and wonderful tones.</td>', 'Lovely image, nice texture, and wonderful tones.', '2012-05-21 09:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774266, 1016263, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am mad for this.  To me, it exemplifies Adam''s use of contrast.  I love the winding creek.  Adds a nice curve to the angular feel of the middle area.  Loving those clouds!!</td>', 'I am mad for this.  To me, it exemplifies Adam''s use of contrast.  I love the winding creek.  Adds a nice curve to the angular feel of the middle area.  Loving those clouds!!', '2012-05-21 09:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774267, 1016121, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image. Lovely dimension.</td>', 'Outstanding image. Lovely dimension.', '2012-05-21 09:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774268, 1015949, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous work!</td>', 'Gorgeous work!', '2012-05-21 09:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774269, 1016347, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like this one because of its depth. The tones are perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful. I like this one because of its depth. The tones are perfect.', '2012-05-21 09:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774270, 1016279, 10848, '<td valign="top">WOW love this. You really captured the essence of using your tones to accentuate the textures and depth of this image. Good luck!</td>', 'WOW love this. You really captured the essence of using your tones to accentuate the textures and depth of this image. Good luck!', '2012-05-21 09:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774271, 1016566, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2012-05-21 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774273, 1016359, 15711, '<td valign="top">You aced the contrasts that Adams showcased so well.  I feel as if I could reach out and touch that grass!</td>', 'You aced the contrasts that Adams showcased so well.  I feel as if I could reach out and touch that grass!', '2012-05-21 09:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774274, 1016347, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love it.  Great textures.  That single tree to the left is a nice touch.  Gives the eye a place to rest, in an unexpected place.</td>', 'I love it.  Great textures.  That single tree to the left is a nice touch.  Gives the eye a place to rest, in an unexpected place.', '2012-05-21 09:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774275, 1016279, 15711, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be straight out of his archives.</td>', 'This looks like it could be straight out of his archives.', '2012-05-21 09:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774276, 1016580, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is yummy.  Great use of all of the tonal ranges.</td>', 'This is yummy.  Great use of all of the tonal ranges.', '2012-05-21 09:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
