(6774288, 1016418, 145329, '<td valign="top">LOVE the title.</td>', 'LOVE the title.', '2012-05-21 09:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774289, 1016300, 73942, '<td valign="top">NB, I know this river well. I believe Petitcdiac means "bends like a bow" in Mi''kmaq.  Love the sunrays.</td>', 'NB, I know this river well. I believe Petitcdiac means "bends like a bow" in Mi''kmaq.  Love the sunrays.', '2012-05-21 09:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774297, 1016310, 73942, '<td valign="top">I think I may have cropped a bit from the top in this to emphasize the bottom.  Nice entry.</td>', 'I think I may have cropped a bit from the top in this to emphasize the bottom.  Nice entry.', '2012-05-21 09:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774331, 1016263, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Maybe a little subpar on the sharpness.  But overall, I think this could be a top contender.<br/> <br/>I''ll come back and vote later, but this one stands out.</td>', 'Great shot.  Maybe a little subpar on the sharpness.  But overall, I think this could be a top contender. I''ll come back and vote later, but this one stands out.', '2012-05-21 10:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774339, 1016430, 12611, '<td valign="top">impressive, hypnotic.</td>', 'impressive, hypnotic.', '2012-05-21 10:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774341, 1016361, 12611, '<td valign="top">The incorporating of the rocks makes it for me.</td>', 'The incorporating of the rocks makes it for me.', '2012-05-21 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774342, 1016567, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice tree line, rock lines, and the reflection is a bonus.</td>', 'nice tree line, rock lines, and the reflection is a bonus.', '2012-05-21 10:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774344, 1016452, 12611, '<td valign="top">great composition.</td>', 'great composition.', '2012-05-21 10:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774349, 1016359, 12611, '<td valign="top">the processing of the clouds in the water is just too expertly done, (and the smoothness is the hallmark of a Canon EF 24-105mm f/4.0L IS? )</td>', 'the processing of the clouds in the water is just too expertly done, (and the smoothness is the hallmark of a Canon EF 24-105mm f/4.0L IS? )', '2012-05-21 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774468, 1016541, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great element of interest in that magnificent tree.  Gorgeous ocean and beach with interesting sky above.    I like the contrast very much.  Maybe the drama could have been enhanced with darker "blues" in the sky and water and a little less darkness in the tree.  But, I like the image very much.  It''s one of my picks for top 10.</td>', 'Great element of interest in that magnificent tree.  Gorgeous ocean and beach with interesting sky above.    I like the contrast very much.  Maybe the drama could have been enhanced with darker "blues" in the sky and water and a little less darkness in the tree.  But, I like the image very much.  It''s one of my picks for top 10.', '2012-05-21 13:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774476, 1016166, 54446, '<td valign="top">Elegant image which is highly representative of AA''s style.  Great lighting on the subject with dark bg to add emphasis up front.  Not exactly sure why you mentioned Princeton, NJ in the title.  (no points off, but it''s not relevant to the challenge)</td>', 'Elegant image which is highly representative of AA''s style.  Great lighting on the subject with dark bg to add emphasis up front.  Not exactly sure why you mentioned Princeton, NJ in the title.  (no points off, but it''s not relevant to the challenge)', '2012-05-21 14:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774479, 1016452, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Interesting light and shadow interplay.</td>', 'Good composition.  Interesting light and shadow interplay.', '2012-05-21 14:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774482, 1016464, 54446, '<td valign="top">Super great sky and clouds.  Exceptionally good control of exposure throughout.  The fjord and the surrounding shoreline provide an interesting base for the drama above.</td>', 'Super great sky and clouds.  Exceptionally good control of exposure throughout.  The fjord and the surrounding shoreline provide an interesting base for the drama above.', '2012-05-21 14:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774483, 1016438, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice go at AA''s portrait style. I like the grey''s and I think you did good with the light and shadow. AA''s portrait subjects always remind me of my high school shop teachers... Old guy with a brill cream hairdo in a lab coat or plain shirt with thick rimmmed black glasses. I see you went with the brill cream hairdo and the plain style shirt! lol!</td>', 'Nice go at AA''s portrait style. I like the grey''s and I think you did good with the light and shadow. AA''s portrait subjects always remind me of my high school shop teachers... Old guy with a brill cream hairdo in a lab coat or plain shirt with thick rimmmed black glasses. I see you went with the brill cream hairdo and the plain style shirt! lol!', '2012-05-21 14:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774484, 1016497, 54446, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable scene to inspect.  Good choice to use the foreground rock formation to ground the scene.  It does create a three dimensional effect.  The layering of lake, forest, mountains and sky are a pleasant combination.  I would have liked to see a bit more clarity and contrast in the midrange to distant peaks.  But, you can only capture what the day offered.</td>', 'Enjoyable scene to inspect.  Good choice to use the foreground rock formation to ground the scene.  It does create a three dimensional effect.  The layering of lake, forest, mountains and sky are a pleasant combination.  I would have liked to see a bit more clarity and contrast in the midrange to distant peaks.  But, you can only capture what the day offered.', '2012-05-21 14:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774485, 1015796, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice shape and form to the subject. Very nice dark sky. I think overall the photo is over sharpened. It has that great western American desert feel and the harsher lighting was dealt with nicely.</td>', 'Nice shape and form to the subject. Very nice dark sky. I think overall the photo is over sharpened. It has that great western American desert feel and the harsher lighting was dealt with nicely.', '2012-05-21 14:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774488, 1015634, 145829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2012-05-21 14:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774489, 1016541, 145829, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous</td>', 'Gorgeous', '2012-05-21 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774490, 1016263, 145829, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot. I feel like it may have too much grain with contrast to resemble AA, but I may be wrong. He did have a range of style.</td>', 'this is a great shot. I feel like it may have too much grain with contrast to resemble AA, but I may be wrong. He did have a range of style.', '2012-05-21 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
