(6774494, 1016496, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice, but I feel like you have too much of a hot spot in the water</td>', 'nice, but I feel like you have too much of a hot spot in the water', '2012-05-21 14:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774495, 1016245, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice shot - love the detail - 9</td>', 'nice shot - love the detail - 9', '2012-05-21 14:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774514, 1016489, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the sky  Great clouds and nice gradient in the blue.  I find the rocks in the foreground to be "too much" of the scene.  I understand why you presented the portrait orientation.  The peak to the valley beyond and below begs to be seen.  I wasn''t there, so maybe you are cropping out something in the distance.  But, I would have preferred a landscape orientation with this scene, showing more depth into the distant valley.</td>', 'I like the sky  Great clouds and nice gradient in the blue.  I find the rocks in the foreground to be "too much" of the scene.  I understand why you presented the portrait orientation.  The peak to the valley beyond and below begs to be seen.  I wasn''t there, so maybe you are cropping out something in the distance.  But, I would have preferred a landscape orientation with this scene, showing more depth into the distant valley.', '2012-05-21 14:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774521, 1016580, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sky reflected in the water is quite bright relative to the brightness of the sky itself.  Great fog wisps on the river.  The acute angle to the sun has created quite a few silhouettes, which are interesting shapes and forms, but also represent lost detail in the shadows.</td>', 'The sky reflected in the water is quite bright relative to the brightness of the sky itself.  Great fog wisps on the river.  The acute angle to the sun has created quite a few silhouettes, which are interesting shapes and forms, but also represent lost detail in the shadows.', '2012-05-21 14:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774531, 1016567, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail in the rocks and pool.  Pleasant LH reflection.  The sky was not very kind to you.  I think you managed it well, but the ridgeline trees are in deep silhouette and the sky sort of consumes the detail there.  It''s a very good effort.</td>', 'Wonderful detail in the rocks and pool.  Pleasant LH reflection.  The sky was not very kind to you.  I think you managed it well, but the ridgeline trees are in deep silhouette and the sky sort of consumes the detail there.  It''s a very good effort.', '2012-05-21 15:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774532, 1016347, 54446, '<td valign="top">Possibly an overcast sky with snow laden clouds.  The sky''s lack of features and detail distract from what is an otherwide great job on the rocks and river.  Super job of controlling shadow detail.</td>', 'Possibly an overcast sky with snow laden clouds.  The sky''s lack of features and detail distract from what is an otherwide great job on the rocks and river.  Super job of controlling shadow detail.', '2012-05-21 15:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774539, 1016454, 54446, '<td valign="top">Truly beautiful.  My opinion is the conversion from color to B&amp;W could have produced a more dynamic tonal range.  As elegant as this is, the monochrome version seems slightly flat and possibly underexposed.  Needs more dynamic light.</td>', 'Truly beautiful.  My opinion is the conversion from color to B&W could have produced a more dynamic tonal range.  As elegant as this is, the monochrome version seems slightly flat and possibly underexposed.  Needs more dynamic light.', '2012-05-21 15:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774541, 1016310, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great clouds.  Good detail and control of exposure.  I also think you''ve presented the sky in a favorable manner.  I think the land portion needs another element of interest or more detail to give a better frame of reference for the magnificent heavens above.</td>', 'Great clouds.  Good detail and control of exposure.  I also think you''ve presented the sky in a favorable manner.  I think the land portion needs another element of interest or more detail to give a better frame of reference for the magnificent heavens above.', '2012-05-21 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774543, 1015870, 54446, '<td valign="top">A bit too much center middle for me.  While I think the highlight detail was well contained, the shadow detail is lost in several shady areas.  It appears to be a high contrast time of day.  I do like the tone of the sky and the sky gradient.</td>', 'A bit too much center middle for me.  While I think the highlight detail was well contained, the shadow detail is lost in several shady areas.  It appears to be a high contrast time of day.  I do like the tone of the sky and the sky gradient.', '2012-05-21 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774546, 1016245, 54446, '<td valign="top">Geologically interesting, as this shows various historical levels of lake/river.  Great detail on the stone wall.  Lovely luminous glow on the water.  I think this needs an additional element of interest, especially a focal point.</td>', 'Geologically interesting, as this shows various historical levels of lake/river.  Great detail on the stone wall.  Lovely luminous glow on the water.  I think this needs an additional element of interest, especially a focal point.', '2012-05-21 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774550, 1016300, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sun rays out there.  They are the strongest part of the scene.  Because of the acute angle to the sun, much of detail on the shady side of the rocks and trees is lost, as in blocked up shadows.    The detail in the foreground shows good clarity.  Grounds the scene well.</td>', 'Beautiful sun rays out there.  They are the strongest part of the scene.  Because of the acute angle to the sun, much of detail on the shady side of the rocks and trees is lost, as in blocked up shadows.    The detail in the foreground shows good clarity.  Grounds the scene well.', '2012-05-21 15:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774554, 1016351, 68504, '<td valign="top">I may have found the dog.</td>', 'I may have found the dog.', '2012-05-21 15:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774556, 1016465, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great sky.... wonderful clouds and dramatic sky conversion to monochrome.  I like the toning here.... possibly some Selenium toning.  The view to the mountains seems a bit hazy.  Could be the time of day and the acute to the sun.  Some detail lost in the shadows of the forest and the lodgepole pine stack.  The manmade structure on the left is not a plus.  I do like the layers (foreground, wood pile, forest, mountains, sky).</td>', 'Great sky.... wonderful clouds and dramatic sky conversion to monochrome.  I like the toning here.... possibly some Selenium toning.  The view to the mountains seems a bit hazy.  Could be the time of day and the acute to the sun.  Some detail lost in the shadows of the forest and the lodgepole pine stack.  The manmade structure on the left is not a plus.  I do like the layers (foreground, wood pile, forest, mountains, sky).', '2012-05-21 15:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774557, 1015527, 50011, '<td valign="top">I like this point of view. Nice</td>', 'I like this point of view. Nice', '2012-05-21 15:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774559, 1016580, 50011, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W conversion.</td>', 'Nice B/W conversion.', '2012-05-21 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774561, 1016465, 50011, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like it.</td>', 'Very nice. I like it.', '2012-05-21 15:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774564, 1016564, 50011, '<td valign="top">Like this photo. Nice point of view.</td>', 'Like this photo. Nice point of view.', '2012-05-21 15:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774565, 1016246, 50011, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2012-05-21 15:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774567, 1016385, 54446, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky.  Wonderful scene.  Pretty good control of detail in the shadows.  Some detail lost in the tree reflection in the water, but it''s not unnatural.  I fully understand why you are presenting a portrait orientation image.    The viewer is looking into a canyon/waterway.  Feels a little tightly cropped from side to side.  Overall, a beautiful image which I expect will be a top 10.</td>', 'Dramatic sky.  Wonderful scene.  Pretty good control of detail in the shadows.  Some detail lost in the tree reflection in the water, but it''s not unnatural.  I fully understand why you are presenting a portrait orientation image.    The viewer is looking into a canyon/waterway.  Feels a little tightly cropped from side to side.  Overall, a beautiful image which I expect will be a top 10.', '2012-05-21 15:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774569, 1016541, 50011, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unusuall.</td>', 'Interesting and unusuall.', '2012-05-21 15:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774570, 1016452, 50011, '<td valign="top">Nice. Like the shadows and repetition.</td>', 'Nice. Like the shadows and repetition.', '2012-05-21 15:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774572, 1016405, 50011, '<td valign="top">Great. Very nice. Well done.</td>', 'Great. Very nice. Well done.', '2012-05-21 15:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774574, 1016578, 145829, '<td valign="top">great lighting - 9 - this reminds me of his aspen shots</td>', 'great lighting - 9 - this reminds me of his aspen shots', '2012-05-21 15:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774576, 1016222, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting building.</td>', 'Interesting building.', '2012-05-21 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774577, 1016279, 145829, '<td valign="top">10! - stunning</td>', '10! - stunning', '2012-05-21 15:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774578, 1015546, 50011, '<td valign="top">Very well done. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very well done. One of my favorites.', '2012-05-21 15:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774579, 1016385, 145829, '<td valign="top">beautiful - 9</td>', 'beautiful - 9', '2012-05-21 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774580, 1016331, 35545, '<td valign="top">Really nice range of tones.</td>', 'Really nice range of tones.', '2012-05-21 15:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774582, 1016383, 145829, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2012-05-21 15:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774583, 1016494, 145829, '<td valign="top">very nice. love the lighting - 8</td>', 'very nice. love the lighting - 8', '2012-05-21 15:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774584, 1016378, 35545, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous clouds!  Nice details and range of tones.</td>', 'Gorgeous clouds!  Nice details and range of tones.', '2012-05-21 15:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774586, 1016154, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent conversion to b&amp;w.  You nailed the focus and detail on the flower.  That said, the wood grain is OOF.  The lack of deep DOF creates a  distraction.  I admire the control of exposure, especially on the flower which has superb detail in the shadows and no blown out highlights.</td>', 'Excellent conversion to b&w.  You nailed the focus and detail on the flower.  That said, the wood grain is OOF.  The lack of deep DOF creates a  distraction.  I admire the control of exposure, especially on the flower which has superb detail in the shadows and no blown out highlights.', '2012-05-21 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774587, 1015740, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and landscape, but needs more detail in shadows.</td>', 'Nice sky and landscape, but needs more detail in shadows.', '2012-05-21 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774588, 1015569, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, but I don''t really see Ansel''s hand.</td>', 'I really like the shot, but I don''t really see Ansel''s hand.', '2012-05-21 15:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774592, 1016533, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but could use more contrast.</td>', 'Nice composition, but could use more contrast.', '2012-05-21 15:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774594, 1016575, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful crepuscular rays.  The acute angle to the sun did create silhouetted trees, far shore and beach.   The water horizon shows some lens barrel distortion or fisheye effect.  I might have fixed that for an AA challenge. The glow on the water is nice.  The scene is nicely framed by the trees.</td>', 'Wonderful crepuscular rays.  The acute angle to the sun did create silhouetted trees, far shore and beach.   The water horizon shows some lens barrel distortion or fisheye effect.  I might have fixed that for an AA challenge. The glow on the water is nice.  The scene is nicely framed by the trees.', '2012-05-21 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774596, 1016427, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, but could use more contrast.</td>', 'Nice detail, but could use more contrast.', '2012-05-21 15:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774599, 1016564, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good detail throughout.  I like the slight sepia tone.  Good job on the sky with interesting clouds.  <br/>The structure of the clouds could have been bumped a bit.  Overall, the image is a bit flat (due to the overcast sky, I''m sure).  This image would have benefitted from a wider tonal range which would have been represented by highlight and shadow interplay.</td>', 'Good detail throughout.  I like the slight sepia tone.  Good job on the sky with interesting clouds.  The structure of the clouds could have been bumped a bit.  Overall, the image is a bit flat (due to the overcast sky, I''m sure).  This image would have benefitted from a wider tonal range which would have been represented by highlight and shadow interplay.', '2012-05-21 15:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774600, 1016498, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice, it is a little dark in the foreground, but nice sky. - 6</td>', 'nice, it is a little dark in the foreground, but nice sky. - 6', '2012-05-21 15:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774601, 1016438, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty good b&amp;w portrait.  Well done!</td>', 'Pretty good b&w portrait.  Well done!', '2012-05-21 15:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774602, 1016348, 145829, '<td valign="top">well done - 8</td>', 'well done - 8', '2012-05-21 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774603, 1015569, 145829, '<td valign="top">Do you have an example of an AA shot that does this? If so that will affect my score. I will hold off scoring for now.</td>', 'Do you have an example of an AA shot that does this? If so that will affect my score. I will hold off scoring for now.', '2012-05-21 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774604, 1016488, 145829, '<td valign="top">nice - 8</td>', 'nice - 8', '2012-05-21 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774605, 1016405, 145829, '<td valign="top">beautiful - 10</td>', 'beautiful - 10', '2012-05-21 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774606, 1016315, 145829, '<td valign="top">10 - beautiful</td>', '10 - beautiful', '2012-05-21 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774607, 1015987, 54446, '<td valign="top">Some cloning artifacts in the upper right and upper middle.  Not sure what is going on there. I love the top of the beach vegetation.  The sand detail is okay.  I think the sky is a distraction because of the blur.  Whether it is an issue of not enough DOF depth, or not, it takes away the joy in this image for me.  There appear to be several areas of blown out highlights in the upper half of the image.</td>', 'Some cloning artifacts in the upper right and upper middle.  Not sure what is going on there. I love the top of the beach vegetation.  The sand detail is okay.  I think the sky is a distraction because of the blur.  Whether it is an issue of not enough DOF depth, or not, it takes away the joy in this image for me.  There appear to be several areas of blown out highlights in the upper half of the image.', '2012-05-21 16:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774609, 1016309, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent tree root study.  Well exposed with great detail in the shadows.  The sky beyond is lost (blown out).  Not sure about including the structures in this scene.  While the DOF plane is deep, I''m not sure what you want us to see.  The house and buildings behind draw my eye away from the nature scene.</td>', 'Excellent tree root study.  Well exposed with great detail in the shadows.  The sky beyond is lost (blown out).  Not sure about including the structures in this scene.  While the DOF plane is deep, I''m not sure what you want us to see.  The house and buildings behind draw my eye away from the nature scene.', '2012-05-21 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774611, 1016331, 54446, '<td valign="top">Proportionally, that is too much road &amp; building and not enough mountains and sky.  Makes me want to step to the left by 100 feet and see what lies beyond.  There are elements of the sky and clouds and mountains which suggest wonderful landscape.  I just don''t fell the historic barn is detailed enough or close enough to see details.  That is quite a roof.  In my part of the country, that roof would collapse under the snow load.</td>', 'Proportionally, that is too much road & building and not enough mountains and sky.  Makes me want to step to the left by 100 feet and see what lies beyond.  There are elements of the sky and clouds and mountains which suggest wonderful landscape.  I just don''t fell the historic barn is detailed enough or close enough to see details.  That is quite a roof.  In my part of the country, that roof would collapse under the snow load.', '2012-05-21 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774622, 1016246, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting IR image.  For this AA challenge, I wish the sharp focus in the middle portion extended to the edges of the image.  The dark tones are pretty dark, with some shadows block up.  The detail in the foliage is wonderful.</td>', 'Interesting IR image.  For this AA challenge, I wish the sharp focus in the middle portion extended to the edges of the image.  The dark tones are pretty dark, with some shadows block up.  The detail in the foliage is wonderful.', '2012-05-21 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774626, 1016420, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Pretty harsh light and your shot angle i acute to the sun.  I''m not sure about the compositon and portrait orientation.  To me, this feels crunched and cropped too tightly from side to side.  I do like the head on, over the back, view of this scene.  Your control of exposure is good with little detail (if any) lost in the shadows.</td>', 'Very good.  Pretty harsh light and your shot angle i acute to the sun.  I''m not sure about the compositon and portrait orientation.  To me, this feels crunched and cropped too tightly from side to side.  I do like the head on, over the back, view of this scene.  Your control of exposure is good with little detail (if any) lost in the shadows.', '2012-05-21 16:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774628, 1016430, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot has wonderfule light, great lines and great tones. Clearly a landscape, the scape of the land has an abstract look. In my humble opinion, Ansel was more of a realist than an impressionist in his photography, abundantly depicting scenes of classic American mid-western scenes. Truly a wonderful photo! Would this be an example of Ansel had he shot this scene? I don''t know.</td>', 'This shot has wonderfule light, great lines and great tones. Clearly a landscape, the scape of the land has an abstract look. In my humble opinion, Ansel was more of a realist than an impressionist in his photography, abundantly depicting scenes of classic American mid-western scenes. Truly a wonderful photo! Would this be an example of Ansel had he shot this scene? I don''t know.', '2012-05-21 16:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774631, 1016378, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice distant cumulonimbus.   I do like the tree with moss hanging down.  There is some halo brightness around the tree, which is a slight negative.  There is toning on this image.  I respect your choice to use this toning, but I find it to be a distraction keeping me from loving the scene.</td>', 'Pretty nice distant cumulonimbus.   I do like the tree with moss hanging down.  There is some halo brightness around the tree, which is a slight negative.  There is toning on this image.  I respect your choice to use this toning, but I find it to be a distraction keeping me from loving the scene.', '2012-05-21 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774634, 1016359, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot has that classic lighting and texture in scenes from the cape that I have seen <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> capture so well. That horizon is plumb and horizontal but it sure has the look of being tilted. Love the dark grey and blacks captured in the grasses. The form of the hillside in the background is almost mirrored by the line and shape of the cloud on the opposite side of the photo.</td>', 'This shot has that classic lighting and texture in scenes from the cape that I have seen  Bear_Music capture so well. That horizon is plumb and horizontal but it sure has the look of being tilted. Love the dark grey and blacks captured in the grasses. The form of the hillside in the background is almost mirrored by the line and shape of the cloud on the opposite side of the photo.', '2012-05-21 16:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774635, 1016504, 54446, '<td valign="top">A very nice aspen grove, it is.  The light situation seems to be harsh.  I might have tried some different color channel filters during conversion to monochrome.  Although, I think you''ve presented the sky nicely.  The cloud over the peak is mighty bright.  The mountain is pretty good with regards to tone, although it looks somewhat overprocessed.  It''s possible the image is slightly oversharpened.    A few areas of local contrast look stressed.</td>', 'A very nice aspen grove, it is.  The light situation seems to be harsh.  I might have tried some different color channel filters during conversion to monochrome.  Although, I think you''ve presented the sky nicely.  The cloud over the peak is mighty bright.  The mountain is pretty good with regards to tone, although it looks somewhat overprocessed.  It''s possible the image is slightly oversharpened.    A few areas of local contrast look stressed.', '2012-05-21 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774637, 1016121, 54446, '<td valign="top">While I like the numerous silhouettes in this scene, it does mean some shadow detail has been blocked up.  This is a very attractive seascape with wonderful elements of interest.  I really like the sky detail and tones.</td>', 'While I like the numerous silhouettes in this scene, it does mean some shadow detail has been blocked up.  This is a very attractive seascape with wonderful elements of interest.  I really like the sky detail and tones.', '2012-05-21 16:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774638, 1016549, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and range of tones.  Looks a lot like the Central Valley of California!</td>', 'Nice detail and range of tones.  Looks a lot like the Central Valley of California!', '2012-05-21 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774639, 1016539, 54446, '<td valign="top">I truly like the exposure, with no blown out highlights.  A slightly longer shutter speed would have given a smoother water flow.  Some detail is lost in the background shadows, but it doesn''t bother me.  I think this is a very well composed image from an interesting pov.</td>', 'I truly like the exposure, with no blown out highlights.  A slightly longer shutter speed would have given a smoother water flow.  Some detail is lost in the background shadows, but it doesn''t bother me.  I think this is a very well composed image from an interesting pov.', '2012-05-21 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774647, 1016578, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the deep DOF.  There are some hot spots ( or very white) areas on the petals.  In the other areas of the flower, the detail and exposure is good.  Not sure about the crop.  I think the image begs for a third blossom, the stem of which appears on the right side.  Somewhat unfortunate crop.  It''s a very natural looking scene.</td>', 'I like the deep DOF.  There are some hot spots ( or very white) areas on the petals.  In the other areas of the flower, the detail and exposure is good.  Not sure about the crop.  I think the image begs for a third blossom, the stem of which appears on the right side.  Somewhat unfortunate crop.  It''s a very natural looking scene.', '2012-05-21 16:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774652, 1016263, 54446, '<td valign="top">Grand scene.  While it isn''t a high key image, the brighter tones are a bit glaring.  I do like the sky and clouds in the top 20% of hte scene.   The clouds directly over the mountain range seem unnatural.  The snow on the mountains can be sun reflectors.  Looks like the snow areas have been throttled back.  The barn is a good element of interest as is the stream flowing through.    I think the barn and the area in front of the barn look overexposed.  I wish I had liked this better.</td>', 'Grand scene.  While it isn''t a high key image, the brighter tones are a bit glaring.  I do like the sky and clouds in the top 20% of hte scene.   The clouds directly over the mountain range seem unnatural.  The snow on the mountains can be sun reflectors.  Looks like the snow areas have been throttled back.  The barn is a good element of interest as is the stream flowing through.    I think the barn and the area in front of the barn look overexposed.  I wish I had liked this better.', '2012-05-21 16:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774653, 1016562, 54446, '<td valign="top">As you might guess, I love this scene.  For the AA challenge, I think there are too many midtones dominating the scene.  The strength of the image is the sun rays and teh silhouette of the mountains.  The silver lining to the clouds accompanying the annular eclipse are interesting and dramatic.  The highlights vs. the gray clouds make it better than a flat image.</td>', 'As you might guess, I love this scene.  For the AA challenge, I think there are too many midtones dominating the scene.  The strength of the image is the sun rays and teh silhouette of the mountains.  The silver lining to the clouds accompanying the annular eclipse are interesting and dramatic.  The highlights vs. the gray clouds make it better than a flat image.', '2012-05-21 16:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774654, 1016492, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting POV.    I''d like the image more if the bottom 25% was in focus, too.  Nice detail in the bark in the center middle.</td>', 'Interesting POV.    I''d like the image more if the bottom 25% was in focus, too.  Nice detail in the bark in the center middle.', '2012-05-21 16:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774658, 1015740, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting rolling hills and cemetary with good cloud detail overhead.    Very good deep DOF.  Some shadow detail lost in the middle ground trees.  I think this image looks like a simple monochrome conversion.  Might be more dynamic with a channel mixer conversion.  You have a lot of middle tone grays and not quite enough rich tonal range.</td>', 'Interesting rolling hills and cemetary with good cloud detail overhead.    Very good deep DOF.  Some shadow detail lost in the middle ground trees.  I think this image looks like a simple monochrome conversion.  Might be more dynamic with a channel mixer conversion.  You have a lot of middle tone grays and not quite enough rich tonal range.', '2012-05-21 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774659, 1016446, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great river and trees and river bank.  I love those parts of the scene.  I''m not liking the sky and clouds very much.  Not sure what happened, but the end result is strained.  The reflection in the river is very pleasant.</td>', 'Great river and trees and river bank.  I love those parts of the scene.  I''m not liking the sky and clouds very much.  Not sure what happened, but the end result is strained.  The reflection in the river is very pleasant.', '2012-05-21 17:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774660, 1016566, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very wonderful river "snaking" through this valley.  I like the lower portion of this scene the best.  The forest has very good detail and you didn''t lose detail in that area (or any area).  That said, the forest is pretty dark relative to the foreground and sky.  The mountains and snow are just fine, but somewhat too center-middle to be harmoniously composed.  I assume the sky was overcast with some midlevel cloud detail.  That would explain why you left the sky somwhat light gray tone.  If the sky had blue, you could have shifted around the tones of this entire landscape (lighter trees, darker sky and more detailed clouds).</td>', 'Very wonderful river "snaking" through this valley.  I like the lower portion of this scene the best.  The forest has very good detail and you didn''t lose detail in that area (or any area).  That said, the forest is pretty dark relative to the foreground and sky.  The mountains and snow are just fine, but somewhat too center-middle to be harmoniously composed.  I assume the sky was overcast with some midlevel cloud detail.  That would explain why you left the sky somwhat light gray tone.  If the sky had blue, you could have shifted around the tones of this entire landscape (lighter trees, darker sky and more detailed clouds).', '2012-05-21 17:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774662, 1016109, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and clouds.  Interesting tree with good detail and exposure.  Sort of an exotic (to me) look to the sand and ridge vegetation.  Pretty good control of the overall exposure and a good presentation of tonal range.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and clouds.  Interesting tree with good detail and exposure.  Sort of an exotic (to me) look to the sand and ridge vegetation.  Pretty good control of the overall exposure and a good presentation of tonal range.', '2012-05-21 17:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774666, 1015527, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great cow herd.  I love the clarity and contrast of the lower 40% of the image.  Beautiful pastoral scene.  I find the clouds overhead to be blurred, with very soft detail.  You have a deep DOF encompassing the cow herd.  It''s almost like the sky doesn''t fit the scene.  Taht said, I like the tone of the sky.  And, the clouds are not overexposed.</td>', 'Great cow herd.  I love the clarity and contrast of the lower 40% of the image.  Beautiful pastoral scene.  I find the clouds overhead to be blurred, with very soft detail.  You have a deep DOF encompassing the cow herd.  It''s almost like the sky doesn''t fit the scene.  Taht said, I like the tone of the sky.  And, the clouds are not overexposed.', '2012-05-21 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774667, 1016228, 54446, '<td valign="top">I''m not exactly sure, but it appears the scene needs a clockwise rotation to square the horizon.</td>', 'I''m not exactly sure, but it appears the scene needs a clockwise rotation to square the horizon.', '2012-05-21 17:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774669, 1016576, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good atmospherics.  Rain, fog, low clouds tend to produce a lower contrast image.  You do have elements in this scene which have good contrast.  I think it''s a natural looking scene.  Could use some additional dynamic light, but it''s pretty good, as is.</td>', 'Good atmospherics.  Rain, fog, low clouds tend to produce a lower contrast image.  You do have elements in this scene which have good contrast.  I think it''s a natural looking scene.  Could use some additional dynamic light, but it''s pretty good, as is.', '2012-05-21 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774670, 1016156, 54446, '<td valign="top">Narrow DOF plane, which is well done.  Nicely blurred background bokeh.  Good detail.  The image is a little flat because there is not a lot of dynamic light.  Still, a pleasant image to view.</td>', 'Narrow DOF plane, which is well done.  Nicely blurred background bokeh.  Good detail.  The image is a little flat because there is not a lot of dynamic light.  Still, a pleasant image to view.', '2012-05-21 17:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774672, 1016015, 54446, '<td valign="top">Some detail lost in the shadows in the rocks behind, but it may not be important.  I like the feather detail and feel the highlights on the white feathers are not blown out.</td>', 'Some detail lost in the shadows in the rocks behind, but it may not be important.  I like the feather detail and feel the highlights on the white feathers are not blown out.', '2012-05-21 17:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774674, 1016444, 54446, '<td valign="top">Some detail lost in the shadows.  The toning is okay, but might distract slightly.  The highlights are okay.</td>', 'Some detail lost in the shadows.  The toning is okay, but might distract slightly.  The highlights are okay.', '2012-05-21 17:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774675, 1016435, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice rural scene.  Nice curve to the tree.  It''s a bit flat with regards to tonal range.  Some detail lost in the shadows.</td>', 'Pretty nice rural scene.  Nice curve to the tree.  It''s a bit flat with regards to tonal range.  Some detail lost in the shadows.', '2012-05-21 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774676, 1016533, 54446, '<td valign="top">In the shaded areas, the exposure is well done.  It''s always a problem with scenes like this where the camera can see through to sunlit areas.   Harsh lighting creates lots of challenges for the photographer.  The preponderance of tree limbs above the boat seem cluttered.  The boat itself is an interesting subject.</td>', 'In the shaded areas, the exposure is well done.  It''s always a problem with scenes like this where the camera can see through to sunlit areas.   Harsh lighting creates lots of challenges for the photographer.  The preponderance of tree limbs above the boat seem cluttered.  The boat itself is an interesting subject.', '2012-05-21 17:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774677, 1016434, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful architectural shot.  The tonal range is not wide enough.  I think this image needs more dynamic light.</td>', 'Beautiful architectural shot.  The tonal range is not wide enough.  I think this image needs more dynamic light.', '2012-05-21 17:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774679, 1016522, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great clouds.  The sky is bright relative to the hills, trees, forest and meadow. I suspect this may be a straightaway monochrome conversion.  (I apologize if I''m wrong.)  A channel mixer conversion to monochrome may have produced a more dramatic result.</td>', 'Great clouds.  The sky is bright relative to the hills, trees, forest and meadow. I suspect this may be a straightaway monochrome conversion.  (I apologize if I''m wrong.)  A channel mixer conversion to monochrome may have produced a more dramatic result.', '2012-05-21 17:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774681, 1016485, 54446, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful scene.  There are some artifacts here and there.  And, some posterization/pixelation in the sky.  Looks like a grand place.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful scene.  There are some artifacts here and there.  And, some posterization/pixelation in the sky.  Looks like a grand place.', '2012-05-21 17:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774683, 1016484, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very nice study of cacti.  Really works well as a b&amp;w.  Some detail lost in the shadows due to the harsh light.  I feel you have done well controlling the highlights.</td>', 'Very nice study of cacti.  Really works well as a b&w.  Some detail lost in the shadows due to the harsh light.  I feel you have done well controlling the highlights.', '2012-05-21 17:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774684, 1016561, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good stump.  Pretty good exposure throughout, with good detail.  Some areas in lower middle seem soft.  I''d love to see more environmental context.</td>', 'Good stump.  Pretty good exposure throughout, with good detail.  Some areas in lower middle seem soft.  I''d love to see more environmental context.', '2012-05-21 17:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774686, 1016299, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good dark bg, which throws attention to the blossom.  I like the look under and through to see the flower parts.  Seems like some of the highlights may be pure paper white (with loss of detail).  It''s hard to tell on some petals.</td>', 'Good dark bg, which throws attention to the blossom.  I like the look under and through to see the flower parts.  Seems like some of the highlights may be pure paper white (with loss of detail).  It''s hard to tell on some petals.', '2012-05-21 17:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774687, 1016488, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good seagull portrait.  However, this is a flat image.  The dynamic range is not wide.  This would have been fine with more dynamic light bouncing around.</td>', 'Good seagull portrait.  However, this is a flat image.  The dynamic range is not wide.  This would have been fine with more dynamic light bouncing around.', '2012-05-21 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774689, 1016418, 54446, '<td valign="top">The bridge is okay.  The sky lacks contrast and cloud detail.  Too flat.  Same with the river.  The tonal range is limited.</td>', 'The bridge is okay.  The sky lacks contrast and cloud detail.  Too flat.  Same with the river.  The tonal range is limited.', '2012-05-21 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774691, 1016277, 54446, '<td valign="top">Bright highlights in the sun.  Detail lost in the shadows in the shade.  The tree is center-middle, which might have been okay if somehow segregated from the background.</td>', 'Bright highlights in the sun.  Detail lost in the shadows in the shade.  The tree is center-middle, which might have been okay if somehow segregated from the background.', '2012-05-21 17:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774693, 1016498, 54446, '<td valign="top">Some sensor dust spots in the clouds.  The clouds and sky are properly exposed.  The land, vegetation and river seem darkly underexposed.  The focus and DOF are good.</td>', 'Some sensor dust spots in the clouds.  The clouds and sky are properly exposed.  The land, vegetation and river seem darkly underexposed.  The focus and DOF are good.', '2012-05-21 17:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774694, 1016315, 54446, '<td valign="top">Low hanging clouds are tough because they obscure and shade the landscape sometimes.  There is some dynamic light bouncing around.  In general, the expanse of lake is proportionally too much of the scene.</td>', 'Low hanging clouds are tough because they obscure and shade the landscape sometimes.  There is some dynamic light bouncing around.  In general, the expanse of lake is proportionally too much of the scene.', '2012-05-21 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774695, 1016423, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sidelighting is okay with me because you''ve retained most of the detail in the shaded side.  The sky beyond is pretty bright, without detail or gradient.  Your focus and DOF are good.</td>', 'The sidelighting is okay with me because you''ve retained most of the detail in the shaded side.  The sky beyond is pretty bright, without detail or gradient.  Your focus and DOF are good.', '2012-05-21 17:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774697, 1016243, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sky and wispy clouds could have been enhanced to the advantage of this scene.  A bit of detail lost in the deep shade.  I really like the rolling hills with nice trees.  I sense the scene needs an additonal element of interest.</td>', 'The sky and wispy clouds could have been enhanced to the advantage of this scene.  A bit of detail lost in the deep shade.  I really like the rolling hills with nice trees.  I sense the scene needs an additonal element of interest.', '2012-05-21 17:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774699, 1016530, 54446, '<td valign="top">Probably, the shade is too dominant and overwhelming relative to the subject blossom.  Since the blossom is somewhat gray, the entire scene seems to be somewhat underexposed.  You have presented good detail in the blossom and pistols/stamen.</td>', 'Probably, the shade is too dominant and overwhelming relative to the subject blossom.  Since the blossom is somewhat gray, the entire scene seems to be somewhat underexposed.  You have presented good detail in the blossom and pistols/stamen.', '2012-05-21 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774701, 1015634, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and detail in this scene.  Seems to be quite a lot of lost detail in the shadows, although I like the contrast.</td>', 'Good clarity and detail in this scene.  Seems to be quite a lot of lost detail in the shadows, although I like the contrast.', '2012-05-21 17:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774703, 1015424, 54446, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, this seems just slightly soft in focus.  Although I do see some areas of sharp detail.   The arrangement, or shot angle could have been different.... displaying more wood grain detail.  The image is a little flat.  Needs a richer tonal range.</td>', 'On my monitor, this seems just slightly soft in focus.  Although I do see some areas of sharp detail.   The arrangement, or shot angle could have been different.... displaying more wood grain detail.  The image is a little flat.  Needs a richer tonal range.', '2012-05-21 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774704, 1015576, 54446, '<td valign="top">Difficult lighting situation, but well handled.  Ilike the detail in the vegetation.  The sky seems lost.  The shape of the tree and the river are great elements of interest.</td>', 'Difficult lighting situation, but well handled.  Ilike the detail in the vegetation.  The sky seems lost.  The shape of the tree and the river are great elements of interest.', '2012-05-21 18:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774705, 1016549, 54446, '<td valign="top">Well, the power lines provide leading lines into the scene.  The exposure is okay.  I''d like to see more dynamic light, but the overcast sky may have prevented the desired rich tonal range.</td>', 'Well, the power lines provide leading lines into the scene.  The exposure is okay.  I''d like to see more dynamic light, but the overcast sky may have prevented the desired rich tonal range.', '2012-05-21 18:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774707, 1016227, 54446, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit surreal, which is not an insult.  Very good control of highlights and shadows.  The sky is interesting.</td>', 'Looks a bit surreal, which is not an insult.  Very good control of highlights and shadows.  The sky is interesting.', '2012-05-21 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774710, 1016406, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very good tonal range.  A somewhat narrow DOF plane, which is not necessarily bad for this subject.  There are good areas of clarity and sharpness.  The gradients are mostly excellent.</td>', 'Very good tonal range.  A somewhat narrow DOF plane, which is not necessarily bad for this subject.  There are good areas of clarity and sharpness.  The gradients are mostly excellent.', '2012-05-21 18:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774712, 1016351, 54446, '<td valign="top">From a tonal range point of view, this is good.  I do see detail in the dark shadows.</td>', 'From a tonal range point of view, this is good.  I do see detail in the dark shadows.', '2012-05-21 18:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774714, 1016323, 54446, '<td valign="top">A bit stark.  I do like the foreground vegetation.  I think this needs another element of interest.</td>', 'A bit stark.  I do like the foreground vegetation.  I think this needs another element of interest.', '2012-05-21 18:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774716, 1016427, 54446, '<td valign="top">A very pretty flower and foliage.  Shallow DOF, which does throw the attention to the blossoms.   Not sure about the lavender-ish toning.  But, it''s okay.</td>', 'A very pretty flower and foliage.  Shallow DOF, which does throw the attention to the blossoms.   Not sure about the lavender-ish toning.  But, it''s okay.', '2012-05-21 18:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774718, 1016405, 54446, '<td valign="top">Dramatic rock formation.  Super clarity and very nice detail in the rocks.  The sky is foreboding, which adds mood.  A few details lost in the darkest shadows, but I think the image looks very natural.  The dynamic range of the scene is somewhat constrained by the lack of light on this day.  I really like the postprocessing here.</td>', 'Dramatic rock formation.  Super clarity and very nice detail in the rocks.  The sky is foreboding, which adds mood.  A few details lost in the darkest shadows, but I think the image looks very natural.  The dynamic range of the scene is somewhat constrained by the lack of light on this day.  I really like the postprocessing here.', '2012-05-21 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774776, 1016488, 34192, '<td valign="top">Good shot but there are no whites in this image.  Adams made sure to cover all the zones.</td>', 'Good shot but there are no whites in this image.  Adams made sure to cover all the zones.', '2012-05-21 19:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774777, 1016369, 34192, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I wish the midtones were just a bit brighter.  That would allow me to see more into the image. 6</td>', 'Nice.  I wish the midtones were just a bit brighter.  That would allow me to see more into the image. 6', '2012-05-21 19:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774778, 1016452, 34192, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range.  Reminds me of an area of Santa Fe.  Messing with the depth of field to hide the cars would have ruined the rest of the image. My only thought is that, with a person 2/3s down the way, the viewer''s eye would be attracted to that rather than the cars. I love your tonal range, though, and the DOF and point of view.  7</td>', 'Nice tonal range.  Reminds me of an area of Santa Fe.  Messing with the depth of field to hide the cars would have ruined the rest of the image. My only thought is that, with a person 2/3s down the way, the viewer''s eye would be attracted to that rather than the cars. I love your tonal range, though, and the DOF and point of view.  7', '2012-05-21 19:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774780, 1016348, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think you covered the tones very well.  For this scene the image is composed very well. I like the argument with the tree - it works well and its lines are echoed in the fields and the mountains. very well seen. 7</td>', 'I think you covered the tones very well.  For this scene the image is composed very well. I like the argument with the tree - it works well and its lines are echoed in the fields and the mountains. very well seen. 7', '2012-05-21 19:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774784, 1016310, 34192, '<td valign="top">Not a very strong composition. The tones are there but there is no order to them.</td>', 'Not a very strong composition. The tones are there but there is no order to them.', '2012-05-21 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774786, 1016530, 34192, '<td valign="top">It seems to me a lot of the midtones are missing here.  This feels, to me, more of a high contrast image. That leaves the image a little flat.</td>', 'It seems to me a lot of the midtones are missing here.  This feels, to me, more of a high contrast image. That leaves the image a little flat.', '2012-05-21 19:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774787, 1016277, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  I think the composition is a little weak. Not a lot of midtones and a high amount of contrast.</td>', 'I like the lighting.  I think the composition is a little weak. Not a lot of midtones and a high amount of contrast.', '2012-05-21 19:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774789, 1016489, 34192, '<td valign="top">You captured the tonal range well but the composition is a little weak.  The rocks don''t seem to covert to black and white so well - they seem a muddy jumble and it is hard to distinguish them.</td>', 'You captured the tonal range well but the composition is a little weak.  The rocks don''t seem to covert to black and white so well - they seem a muddy jumble and it is hard to distinguish them.', '2012-05-21 19:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774792, 1016549, 34192, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the full tonal range - though the blown out clouds for white is kind of cheating. ;)  I''m not a fan of the composition - I keep wanting to turn towards the right a little to have the poles running down the side of the image. I don''t think the way they cross half the image and then fade away really ''says'' anything.</td>', 'You''ve captured the full tonal range - though the blown out clouds for white is kind of cheating. ;)  I''m not a fan of the composition - I keep wanting to turn towards the right a little to have the poles running down the side of the image. I don''t think the way they cross half the image and then fade away really ''says'' anything.', '2012-05-21 19:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774794, 1016323, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me, this image is empty space and cluttered space.  I think, if you got rid of some of the cluttered space, this would be a much stronger ''minimalist'' image.</td>', 'For me, this image is empty space and cluttered space.  I think, if you got rid of some of the cluttered space, this would be a much stronger ''minimalist'' image.', '2012-05-21 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774801, 1016361, 34192, '<td valign="top">nice. good tonal range. plenty of detail without being over powering.</td>', 'nice. good tonal range. plenty of detail without being over powering.', '2012-05-21 19:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6774803, 1016331, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image is kind of flat to me - needs just a touch more contrast.</td>', 'This image is kind of flat to me - needs just a touch more contrast.', '2012-05-21 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775020, 1016125, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very Ansellish.</td>', 'Very Ansellish.', '2012-05-22 03:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775024, 1016497, 114285, '<td valign="top">This looks like it lacks contrast, it could of looked looming if you darkened the clouds I feel, still good try.</td>', 'This looks like it lacks contrast, it could of looked looming if you darkened the clouds I feel, still good try.', '2012-05-22 03:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775026, 1016418, 114285, '<td valign="top">Dang, you forgot to change the title, still great bridge, not sure if it''s his style though.</td>', 'Dang, you forgot to change the title, still great bridge, not sure if it''s his style though.', '2012-05-22 03:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775031, 1016309, 114285, '<td valign="top">Love the tree roots and how you framed that house in the background well done.</td>', 'Love the tree roots and how you framed that house in the background well done.', '2012-05-22 03:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775032, 1016351, 114285, '<td valign="top">Looks like my doggie, love this.</td>', 'Looks like my doggie, love this.', '2012-05-22 03:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775033, 1015546, 114285, '<td valign="top">Aha we have a winner, most likely.</td>', 'Aha we have a winner, most likely.', '2012-05-22 03:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775035, 1016383, 54446, '<td valign="top">The leaves carry a hint of green on my monitor.  It''s okay, as AA did some color photography.  (And, it might be my imagination.)   The group of three blossoms is harmoniously composed.  You have matched the way AA presented images like this, with subject well illuminated and bg darkened.<br/>I looked at this again.  No color on this review under different ambient lighting.</td>', 'The leaves carry a hint of green on my monitor.  It''s okay, as AA did some color photography.  (And, it might be my imagination.)   The group of three blossoms is harmoniously composed.  You have matched the way AA presented images like this, with subject well illuminated and bg darkened.I looked at this again.  No color on this review under different ambient lighting.', '2012-05-22 04:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775128, 1016419, 113156, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and intresting subject.</td>', 'Nice processing and intresting subject.', '2012-05-22 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775129, 1015949, 113156, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition.</td>', 'Awesome composition.', '2012-05-22 08:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775138, 1016361, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in this challenge.  The composition is very harmonious.  The sky is spectacular.  The clarity of the image is magnificent.  Love the ability to see into the crystal clear water.  Superb control of most of the detail in the shadows.  The tonal range is very pleasant.  I expect this will ribbon with the blue. 10</td>', 'This is my favorite in this challenge.  The composition is very harmonious.  The sky is spectacular.  The clarity of the image is magnificent.  Love the ability to see into the crystal clear water.  Superb control of most of the detail in the shadows.  The tonal range is very pleasant.  I expect this will ribbon with the blue. 10', '2012-05-22 09:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775139, 1016538, 54446, '<td valign="top">Fantastic conversion to b&amp;w.  Super great control of exposure.  I like the detail in the white areas of the petals.  Not easy to do with the dynamic light in play.  Excellent dark background.  I think this may make the top 10.  10</td>', 'Fantastic conversion to b&w.  Super great control of exposure.  I like the detail in the white areas of the petals.  Not easy to do with the dynamic light in play.  Excellent dark background.  I think this may make the top 10.  10', '2012-05-22 09:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775140, 1016430, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great drama and vanishing lines effect to this scene, as the alternating horizontal stripes of sand and water gain distance from the viewer.  To my eye, this is almost an abstract image.   I like the sky treatment and the tonal range is rich .  Superb 3 dimensional effect with the foreground beach grounding the scene.  Who needs mountains, when you have this natural beauty?  One of my top 10 picks.  10</td>', 'Wow!  Great drama and vanishing lines effect to this scene, as the alternating horizontal stripes of sand and water gain distance from the viewer.  To my eye, this is almost an abstract image.   I like the sky treatment and the tonal range is rich .  Superb 3 dimensional effect with the foreground beach grounding the scene.  Who needs mountains, when you have this natural beauty?  One of my top 10 picks.  10', '2012-05-22 09:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775142, 1015546, 54446, '<td valign="top">This really looks like an AA.  Very interesting detail and wonderful tones.  Good job on the sky, too.  Some of the shadow detail in the deepest part of the dune shadow is lost, but it adds to the mood and interest.  Well done!  Should be a ribbon contender.  10</td>', 'This really looks like an AA.  Very interesting detail and wonderful tones.  Good job on the sky, too.  Some of the shadow detail in the deepest part of the dune shadow is lost, but it adds to the mood and interest.  Well done!  Should be a ribbon contender.  10', '2012-05-22 09:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775147, 1016536, 54446, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Great detail and sharpness on the wood grain and most of the flower.  Maybe a slight falloff of sharpness on the edge of the image/flower.  I think the lighting is elegant.  I especially like the shadows, where you have retained the details.   Very good conversion to b&amp;w.  Pretty good composition, too.  9</td>', 'I really like this.  Great detail and sharpness on the wood grain and most of the flower.  Maybe a slight falloff of sharpness on the edge of the image/flower.  I think the lighting is elegant.  I especially like the shadows, where you have retained the details.   Very good conversion to b&w.  Pretty good composition, too.  9', '2012-05-22 09:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775148, 1016326, 54446, '<td valign="top">The foreground elements of the downed old trees in the mirrored water give the image a very pleasing three dimensional effect.  Great control of exposure throughout.  The sky is natural looking enough, with pretty good detail in the wispy clouds.  The far shore seems just a bit distant with some shadow detail lost in the forest.  But, I like the scene.  It''s one of my top 10 picks.  9</td>', 'The foreground elements of the downed old trees in the mirrored water give the image a very pleasing three dimensional effect.  Great control of exposure throughout.  The sky is natural looking enough, with pretty good detail in the wispy clouds.  The far shore seems just a bit distant with some shadow detail lost in the forest.  But, I like the scene.  It''s one of my top 10 picks.  9', '2012-05-22 09:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775149, 1016125, 54446, '<td valign="top">Glorious drama in the sky and rock formation detail.  Masterful retention of detail in the shadows.  Geologically, this is very interesting.  The uplift nature of the rocks and the horizon causes the viewer to stand in awe of the history.  This is a fine representation of the beauty of the wilderness.  One of my top 10 picks.  9</td>', 'Glorious drama in the sky and rock formation detail.  Masterful retention of detail in the shadows.  Geologically, this is very interesting.  The uplift nature of the rocks and the horizon causes the viewer to stand in awe of the history.  This is a fine representation of the beauty of the wilderness.  One of my top 10 picks.  9', '2012-05-22 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6775247, 1016578, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!  Wonderful textures and tones.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is gorgeous!  Wonderful textures and tones.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775250, 1016421, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the ominous sky overhead (voted earlier)</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the ominous sky overhead (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775251, 1016536, 128323, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Some of my favorite Ansel Adams shots were his driftwood pics. (voted earlier)</td>', 'I really like this.  Some of my favorite Ansel Adams shots were his driftwood pics. (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775252, 1016465, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  Great processing in this!  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Very dramatic.  Great processing in this!  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775253, 1016561, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is cool--at first glance, it kind of looked like a flat-top moutain.</td>', 'This is cool--at first glance, it kind of looked like a flat-top moutain.', '2012-05-22 11:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775256, 1016125, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is the best sky in the bunch.  Wonderful tones and composition! (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is the best sky in the bunch.  Wonderful tones and composition! (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775261, 1016496, 128323, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I love the bleak look of this.  Front page for sure.</td>', 'Awesome!  I love the bleak look of this.  Front page for sure.', '2012-05-22 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775262, 1016315, 128323, '<td valign="top">The sky is absolutely amazing here.  Very Ansel-y!  well done!  (voted earlier)</td>', 'The sky is absolutely amazing here.  Very Ansel-y!  well done!  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775263, 1015949, 128323, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of the milky sky and rushing water with the jagged peaks.  Well done!  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Nice contrast of the milky sky and rushing water with the jagged peaks.  Well done!  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775266, 1016522, 128323, '<td valign="top">I like the composition you chose, but it''s a little washed out.  I think a levels adjustment or using the black and white adjustment tool in photoshop to selectively desaturate it might have really added some punch.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'I like the composition you chose, but it''s a little washed out.  I think a levels adjustment or using the black and white adjustment tool in photoshop to selectively desaturate it might have really added some punch.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775267, 1016419, 128323, '<td valign="top">Lovely black and white--the texture is really brought out nicely.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Lovely black and white--the texture is really brought out nicely.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-22 11:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775286, 1016383, 132996, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. The leaves...are indescribable.</td>', 'Fabulous. The leaves...are indescribable.', '2012-05-22 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775379, 1015546, 99412, '<td valign="top">There''s just some Photographs that deserve a 10 because they''re great.<br/>Yours happens to one of them.</td>', 'There''s just some Photographs that deserve a 10 because they''re great.Yours happens to one of them.', '2012-05-22 15:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
