(6778271, 1016087, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the bold composition and areas of tone (sorry I wish I had better terminology).</td>', 'I like the bold composition and areas of tone (sorry I wish I had better terminology).', '2012-05-25 13:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
