(6778291, 1016533, 50695, '<td valign="top">quirky, interesting image</td>', 'quirky, interesting image', '2012-05-25 13:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778292, 1016351, 50695, '<td valign="top">gorgeous<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/></td>', 'gorgeous I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2012-05-25 13:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778299, 1016369, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful view on a rarely becalmed Bear Lake.   Love the look into the bottom of the lake.  Excellent composition.  Sometimes it is a gift to have that Colorado sky muted by overcast.  The fog/mist rising off the lake near the far shore is a great element of interest.  I truly appreciate how precisely you''ve levels the lake horizon.  (Not that easy!)  Superb detail in the rock grain and the forest tree detail.  I hope to see this make the top 10.  10</td>', 'Wonderful view on a rarely becalmed Bear Lake.   Love the look into the bottom of the lake.  Excellent composition.  Sometimes it is a gift to have that Colorado sky muted by overcast.  The fog/mist rising off the lake near the far shore is a great element of interest.  I truly appreciate how precisely you''ve levels the lake horizon.  (Not that easy!)  Superb detail in the rock grain and the forest tree detail.  I hope to see this make the top 10.  10', '2012-05-25 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778301, 1016359, 54446, '<td valign="top">Of all the images I''ve viewed so far, this one represents the style of AA the best.  The detail in the shadows is masterfully presented.  The luminous glow off the pool is superb.  Those distant tidal pools have a very eye-pleasing vanishing lines effect.  The image offers the viewer a sense of peace and serenity, which I''ll bet you experienced in the capture of this scene.  One of my top 10 picks.  10</td>', 'Of all the images I''ve viewed so far, this one represents the style of AA the best.  The detail in the shadows is masterfully presented.  The luminous glow off the pool is superb.  Those distant tidal pools have a very eye-pleasing vanishing lines effect.  The image offers the viewer a sense of peace and serenity, which I''ll bet you experienced in the capture of this scene.  One of my top 10 picks.  10', '2012-05-25 13:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778302, 1015949, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is magnificent.  You have all the elements of a fantastic landscape scene.  I''m impressed with the silk water effect in such a daylight situation.  The control of exposure is wonderful.  The stillness of the foreground vegetation is no easy task accomplished.  The deep DOF really gives a three dimensional effect.  I think the portrait orientation works for this scene.  Great sky and clouds.  I expect this will be a ribbon contender. 10</td>', 'This is magnificent.  You have all the elements of a fantastic landscape scene.  I''m impressed with the silk water effect in such a daylight situation.  The control of exposure is wonderful.  The stillness of the foreground vegetation is no easy task accomplished.  The deep DOF really gives a three dimensional effect.  I think the portrait orientation works for this scene.  Great sky and clouds.  I expect this will be a ribbon contender. 10', '2012-05-25 13:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778303, 1016419, 54446, '<td valign="top">A very expertly rendered architectural shot, which should be treated as a good representation of AA''s style.  Great control of shadow detail.  If this is HDR, it is masterfully done.  Love the clarity and elements of interest.  This is one of my top 10 picks.  10</td>', 'A very expertly rendered architectural shot, which should be treated as a good representation of AA''s style.  Great control of shadow detail.  If this is HDR, it is masterfully done.  Love the clarity and elements of interest.  This is one of my top 10 picks.  10', '2012-05-25 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778366, 1016430, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not a typical Ansel Adams shot but I really love the patterns you captured here. In fact this really makes me think of Freeman Patterson to honest. :)</td>', 'Not a typical Ansel Adams shot but I really love the patterns you captured here. In fact this really makes me think of Freeman Patterson to honest. :)', '2012-05-25 15:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778463, 1016385, 109363, '<td valign="top">great clouds</td>', 'great clouds', '2012-05-25 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778464, 1016309, 109363, '<td valign="top">would have been improved with no inclusion of the background buildings.</td>', 'would have been improved with no inclusion of the background buildings.', '2012-05-25 18:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778467, 1016427, 109363, '<td valign="top">color seems off somehow</td>', 'color seems off somehow', '2012-05-25 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778468, 1016522, 109363, '<td valign="top">looks a little washed out... needs more contrast</td>', 'looks a little washed out... needs more contrast', '2012-05-25 18:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778469, 1016378, 109363, '<td valign="top">the contrast looks a little washed out</td>', 'the contrast looks a little washed out', '2012-05-25 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778470, 1016454, 109363, '<td valign="top">nice blur on the background.  would have liked to see a little more white in the flowers to make it "pop" like Adams</td>', 'nice blur on the background.  would have liked to see a little more white in the flowers to make it "pop" like Adams', '2012-05-25 18:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778472, 1016418, 109363, '<td valign="top">not sure if the light sepia is working here...</td>', 'not sure if the light sepia is working here...', '2012-05-25 18:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778473, 1016222, 109363, '<td valign="top">i think it needs more contrasts... looks flat</td>', 'i think it needs more contrasts... looks flat', '2012-05-25 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778475, 1016434, 109363, '<td valign="top">not seeing enough detail in the shadows under the overhang</td>', 'not seeing enough detail in the shadows under the overhang', '2012-05-25 18:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
