(6778763, 1015634, 128323, '<td valign="top">Pistyll Rhaeadr in Wales?  I googled this due to the very unusual title.  Looks beautiful there!  I think your shot would have done better possibly at a different time of day?  The light seems a bit too hard and the whole image seems a bit too sharp.  It makes it difficult to get good detail out of the trees.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Pistyll Rhaeadr in Wales?  I googled this due to the very unusual title.  Looks beautiful there!  I think your shot would have done better possibly at a different time of day?  The light seems a bit too hard and the whole image seems a bit too sharp.  It makes it difficult to get good detail out of the trees.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-26 07:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
