(6779127, 1016279, 136989, '<td valign="top">The reflection works against you in this one, at least for me, it makes it too busy. Still a nice landscape.</td>', 'The reflection works against you in this one, at least for me, it makes it too busy. Still a nice landscape.', '2012-05-26 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779217, 1015546, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super mono conversion - a strong, bold image that invites the viewer to stay and explore.</td>', 'Super mono conversion - a strong, bold image that invites the viewer to stay and explore.', '2012-05-27 05:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779218, 1016419, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good mono conversion, although not so keen on the cramped composition, in particular the missing section from the bottom of the boat.  A very impressive deep depth of field.</td>', 'A good mono conversion, although not so keen on the cramped composition, in particular the missing section from the bottom of the boat.  A very impressive deep depth of field.', '2012-05-27 05:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779219, 1016125, 67258, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, but doesn''t entirely work for me.  There is much detail, but it is hard to make it all out.  I don''t know whether choosing different colour channels for your conversion would have helped?</td>', 'An interesting photo, but doesn''t entirely work for me.  There is much detail, but it is hard to make it all out.  I don''t know whether choosing different colour channels for your conversion would have helped?', '2012-05-27 05:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779221, 1016427, 67258, '<td valign="top">I have spent a little time reading around Adams work before voting, but would not claim to be well-acquainted, so take my words for whatever they might be worth!  This, both subject wise and in terms of processing doesn''t make me think of Adams.  On a purely subjective view, and separate from the challenge title, the colour caste doesn''t seem to work with the photo, rather pulls against it; the flower and it''s leaves seem to be fighting against the cluttered background, and the mono conversion is fairly bland.</td>', 'I have spent a little time reading around Adams work before voting, but would not claim to be well-acquainted, so take my words for whatever they might be worth!  This, both subject wise and in terms of processing doesn''t make me think of Adams.  On a purely subjective view, and separate from the challenge title, the colour caste doesn''t seem to work with the photo, rather pulls against it; the flower and it''s leaves seem to be fighting against the cluttered background, and the mono conversion is fairly bland.', '2012-05-27 05:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779303, 1016227, 118154, '<td valign="top">Processing has made this for me ,others will no doubt disagree.Hope to see it do well.</td>', 'Processing has made this for me ,others will no doubt disagree.Hope to see it do well.', '2012-05-27 11:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
