(6779307, 1016485, 118154, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little lacking in contrast for the challenge.</td>', 'Seems to be a little lacking in contrast for the challenge.', '2012-05-27 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779308, 1016418, 118154, '<td valign="top">Catchy title,the image I find a bit bland.</td>', 'Catchy title,the image I find a bit bland.', '2012-05-27 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779318, 1016125, 138630, '<td valign="top">This one has it all for me - a great scene with interest throughout WITHOUT a cluttered look, crisp focus from front to back, and an excellent tonal range.  Having an "Ansel-like" subject was not one of my requisites for an excellent score, but it sure doesn''t hurt.  In my top three.</td>', 'This one has it all for me - a great scene with interest throughout WITHOUT a cluttered look, crisp focus from front to back, and an excellent tonal range.  Having an "Ansel-like" subject was not one of my requisites for an excellent score, but it sure doesn''t hurt.  In my top three.', '2012-05-27 12:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779319, 1016361, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great textures and detail in the foreground and midfield and a very nice sky.  The composition balance works for me and the there is an excellent range of tones.  In my top three.</td>', 'Great textures and detail in the foreground and midfield and a very nice sky.  The composition balance works for me and the there is an excellent range of tones.  In my top three.', '2012-05-27 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779321, 1016419, 138630, '<td valign="top">Though I am far from an Ansel expert, this does not strike me as a typical subject; however, that does not detract in the slightest for me.  The lighting, crisp detail even in the shadows, full range of tones from white to black, textures and compositional balance make this entirely suitable for the challenge IMO.  In my top three.</td>', 'Though I am far from an Ansel expert, this does not strike me as a typical subject; however, that does not detract in the slightest for me.  The lighting, crisp detail even in the shadows, full range of tones from white to black, textures and compositional balance make this entirely suitable for the challenge IMO.  In my top three.', '2012-05-27 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779324, 1016494, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is one that I kept bumping.  I really like the strong contrast between the shadow and light areas - the leaves and reflections especially just seem to be dancing.  I could use a bit more detail in the highlights on the trunks.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'This is one that I kept bumping.  I really like the strong contrast between the shadow and light areas - the leaves and reflections especially just seem to be dancing.  I could use a bit more detail in the highlights on the trunks.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 12:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779326, 1016438, 138630, '<td valign="top">Bravo for going the portrait route in this challenge - subject, angle of head, expression and treatment all look very Ansel-like to me.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'Bravo for going the portrait route in this challenge - subject, angle of head, expression and treatment all look very Ansel-like to me.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779330, 1016309, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is not my idea of an Ansel Adams subject or composition (I am no expert and may be wrong), yet it is an image that I suspect he would have liked a lot.  The light - late afternoon, maybe? - on the roots, trunk and branches of this very interesting tree is beautiful, and I am quite taken by the way you used that to frame the lighthouse and out-building.  The tonal range might have been just a bit stronger but there''s such nice detail even in the shadows.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'This is not my idea of an Ansel Adams subject or composition (I am no expert and may be wrong), yet it is an image that I suspect he would have liked a lot.  The light - late afternoon, maybe? - on the roots, trunk and branches of this very interesting tree is beautiful, and I am quite taken by the way you used that to frame the lighthouse and out-building.  The tonal range might have been just a bit stronger but there''s such nice detail even in the shadows.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 13:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779334, 1015546, 138630, '<td valign="top">A classic beauty - hard to beat the great lines and shadow play of dunes like these.  Maybe a bit over-sharpened for my taste but terrific anyway.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'A classic beauty - hard to beat the great lines and shadow play of dunes like these.  Maybe a bit over-sharpened for my taste but terrific anyway.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 13:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779336, 1015949, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the water, the mountains the sky - not as much the brush in the foreground but it''s still a beautiful scene and very nicely processed imo.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'Love the water, the mountains the sky - not as much the brush in the foreground but it''s still a beautiful scene and very nicely processed imo.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779342, 1016567, 138630, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy Pemaquid reflected in the tidal pools - the lines and textures in those foreground rocks are just terrific.  Slightly over-sharpened around the trees but very nicely done.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'I always enjoy Pemaquid reflected in the tidal pools - the lines and textures in those foreground rocks are just terrific.  Slightly over-sharpened around the trees but very nicely done.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 13:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779344, 1016430, 54645, '<td valign="top">Although it''s way too sharp, I love the layers of contrast and mystery of life found through the satisfaction of search.  <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Although it''s way too sharp, I love the layers of contrast and mystery of life found through the satisfaction of search.     ', '2012-05-27 13:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779345, 1016166, 54645, '<td valign="top">Delicious tones. Cheesy, but true.</td>', 'Delicious tones. Cheesy, but true.', '2012-05-27 13:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779347, 1016351, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha. This is fantastic. Humorous title. Erwitt meets Adams.  I''ll give you some worthless bling instead of a 10.<br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ha. This is fantastic. Humorous title. Erwitt meets Adams.  I''ll give you some worthless bling instead of a 10.  ', '2012-05-27 14:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779348, 1016564, 138630, '<td valign="top">The lone tree, the hostile environment that appears to be getting the upper hand, the brooding sky, and the wide tonal range all seem to be very Adams-like to me.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'The lone tree, the hostile environment that appears to be getting the upper hand, the brooding sky, and the wide tonal range all seem to be very Adams-like to me.  One of my top 10.', '2012-05-27 14:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779349, 1015569, 54645, '<td valign="top">Catching a cab to the High Sierras. You know it''s not sharp enough, right?</td>', 'Catching a cab to the High Sierras. You know it''s not sharp enough, right?', '2012-05-27 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779360, 1016423, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light in the capture and processing that maximizes it.  I like the composition, too, and the title and barbed wire that work together to suggest a message.</td>', 'Very nice use of light in the capture and processing that maximizes it.  I like the composition, too, and the title and barbed wire that work together to suggest a message.', '2012-05-27 14:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779361, 1016315, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice elements here - a great sky, interesting mountain face, and the rippling water.  The water is very nice in the way the light and shadow play across it, but I wonder whether there isn''t a bit too much of it . . . 8 from me - voted earlier</td>', 'Nice elements here - a great sky, interesting mountain face, and the rippling water.  The water is very nice in the way the light and shadow play across it, but I wonder whether there isn''t a bit too much of it . . . 8 from me - voted earlier', '2012-05-27 14:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779362, 1016405, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the rugged rock faces and the horizontal interest of the strata.  The sky is nice but not exceptional.  A good entry imo -- 8 - voted earlier</td>', 'Love the rugged rock faces and the horizontal interest of the strata.  The sky is nice but not exceptional.  A good entry imo -- 8 - voted earlier', '2012-05-27 14:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779365, 1016385, 138630, '<td valign="top">What I like best about this scene are all the triangles (foreground rocks, trees on the near bank, trees and their reflection on the far bank, wedge of reflected sky) and the way they fit together so nicely.  It''s a little busy but still nice.  8 - voted earlier</td>', 'What I like best about this scene are all the triangles (foreground rocks, trees on the near bank, trees and their reflection on the far bank, wedge of reflected sky) and the way they fit together so nicely.  It''s a little busy but still nice.  8 - voted earlier', '2012-05-27 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779366, 1016561, 57229, '<td valign="top">extra one for the title...</td>', 'extra one for the title...', '2012-05-27 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779376, 1015546, 116575, '<td valign="top">spectacular. 10</td>', 'spectacular. 10', '2012-05-27 15:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779377, 1016494, 116575, '<td valign="top">i love this! gave it a 10 earlier</td>', 'i love this! gave it a 10 earlier', '2012-05-27 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779378, 1016369, 116575, '<td valign="top">too good, 10 (voted earlier)</td>', 'too good, 10 (voted earlier)', '2012-05-27 15:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779379, 1016166, 116575, '<td valign="top">one of my faves in this challenge, 10 (voted earlier)</td>', 'one of my faves in this challenge, 10 (voted earlier)', '2012-05-27 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779380, 1016125, 116575, '<td valign="top">very impressive, 10 (voted earlier)</td>', 'very impressive, 10 (voted earlier)', '2012-05-27 15:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779384, 1016087, 11769, '<td valign="top">Confined, the dragon is becoming impatient. And yes, this is sharp enough!</td>', 'Confined, the dragon is becoming impatient. And yes, this is sharp enough!', '2012-05-27 15:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779385, 1016359, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.</td>', 'Nice tones.', '2012-05-27 15:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779386, 1016430, 11769, '<td valign="top">AA in abstract! This is a fabulous image.</td>', 'AA in abstract! This is a fabulous image.', '2012-05-27 15:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779387, 1016420, 11769, '<td valign="top">The two in front are conspiring something, maybe a revolt?</td>', 'The two in front are conspiring something, maybe a revolt?', '2012-05-27 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6779388, 1016565, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the path, grass.</td>', 'Love the path, grass.', '2012-05-27 15:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779390, 1016406, 11769, '<td valign="top">I see faces, even a dog!</td>', 'I see faces, even a dog!', '2012-05-27 15:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779391, 1016263, 11769, '<td valign="top">Just a wow from me.</td>', 'Just a wow from me.', '2012-05-27 15:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779392, 1016351, 11769, '<td valign="top">Is that the famous Honeymoon destination? If that doesn''t beat all!</td>', 'Is that the famous Honeymoon destination? If that doesn''t beat all!', '2012-05-27 15:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779393, 1016543, 11769, '<td valign="top">Faceoff</td>', 'Faceoff', '2012-05-27 15:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779394, 1015546, 11769, '<td valign="top">Calming</td>', 'Calming', '2012-05-27 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779395, 1016488, 11769, '<td valign="top">The vignetting adds greatly to this work</td>', 'The vignetting adds greatly to this work', '2012-05-27 15:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779396, 1016561, 11769, '<td valign="top">Someday I plan to visit.</td>', 'Someday I plan to visit.', '2012-05-27 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779399, 1016277, 11769, '<td valign="top">This image makes me feel, this picture was taken today. But it was a long time ago, never to be found again.</td>', 'This image makes me feel, this picture was taken today. But it was a long time ago, never to be found again.', '2012-05-27 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779414, 1016359, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautifully simple and beautifully processed.  The reflection of the clouds in the open area bringing the light down into the midfield and foreground is particularly nice, I think.  8 - voted earlier</td>', 'Beautifully simple and beautifully processed.  The reflection of the clouds in the open area bringing the light down into the midfield and foreground is particularly nice, I think.  8 - voted earlier', '2012-05-27 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779415, 1016369, 138630, '<td valign="top">A lovely contrast between the startling clarity of the lake and the misty background.  8 - voted earlier</td>', 'A lovely contrast between the startling clarity of the lake and the misty background.  8 - voted earlier', '2012-05-27 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779416, 1016166, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the metallic tones here - simple and lovely.  8 - voted earlier</td>', 'I love the metallic tones here - simple and lovely.  8 - voted earlier', '2012-05-27 17:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779419, 1016419, 112828, '<td valign="top">doh!  This crop made the photo so hard to appreciate!!!!<br/> <br/>I love the guy standing in the background, and the oars on the wall...  But why oh why did you not give me the bottom of the stern of this boat??<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''m still giving this an 8, but I would have gladly given a 9 otherwise, and maybe a 10 - it''s an excellent shot. Thanks for sharing it with us.</td>', 'doh!  This crop made the photo so hard to appreciate!!!! I love the guy standing in the background, and the oars on the wall...  But why oh why did you not give me the bottom of the stern of this boat?? Anyway, I''m still giving this an 8, but I would have gladly given a 9 otherwise, and maybe a 10 - it''s an excellent shot. Thanks for sharing it with us.', '2012-05-27 17:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779420, 1016222, 138630, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a beautiful building, but the image lacks a wide range of tones and looks flat.  It could also benefit from some foreground so the palace does not look cut off, a little transform work to correct the lens distortion, and a denoise filter, I think.</td>', 'Looks to be a beautiful building, but the image lacks a wide range of tones and looks flat.  It could also benefit from some foreground so the palace does not look cut off, a little transform work to correct the lens distortion, and a denoise filter, I think.', '2012-05-27 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779425, 1015569, 138630, '<td valign="top">I have tried not to be too narrow in my interpretation of the Ansel Adams "style" so subject (whatever it is) does not count against this.  However, it lacks just about everything else I associate with Adams: clarity, focus, tonal range, etc.  It IS black and white . . .</td>', 'I have tried not to be too narrow in my interpretation of the Ansel Adams "style" so subject (whatever it is) does not count against this.  However, it lacks just about everything else I associate with Adams: clarity, focus, tonal range, etc.  It IS black and white . . .', '2012-05-27 17:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779428, 1015424, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is too soft and flat for me.  I do like the slight angle of the wood surface and the placement of the rose in the frame.</td>', 'This is too soft and flat for me.  I do like the slight angle of the wood surface and the placement of the rose in the frame.', '2012-05-27 17:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779431, 1016454, 138630, '<td valign="top">This lacks the clean look I would associate with Adams and with flowers touched by light.  Nice detail in the petals though.</td>', 'This lacks the clean look I would associate with Adams and with flowers touched by light.  Nice detail in the petals though.', '2012-05-27 17:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779432, 1016565, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the grass and lake. I believe it needs a bit more pop (dodge and burn, Ansel style) but it doesn''t matter much as I''m not voting.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the grass and lake. I believe it needs a bit more pop (dodge and burn, Ansel style) but it doesn''t matter much as I''m not voting.', '2012-05-27 17:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779433, 1016300, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent extreme contrast. Right on target. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Excellent extreme contrast. Right on target. Very nice photo.', '2012-05-27 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779434, 1016351, 138630, '<td valign="top">The tones do range from white to black.  Not sure what you were about here - light on water droplets as a wet dog shakes, maybe?</td>', 'The tones do range from white to black.  Not sure what you were about here - light on water droplets as a wet dog shakes, maybe?', '2012-05-27 17:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779435, 1015527, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Sharp and crisp and high contrast. Well done.</td>', 'Cool shot. Sharp and crisp and high contrast. Well done.', '2012-05-27 17:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779436, 1016228, 138630, '<td valign="top">I need a little more definition in the shadow area, esp under the pier; this falls a bit flat.</td>', 'I need a little more definition in the shadow area, esp under the pier; this falls a bit flat.', '2012-05-27 17:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779439, 1016485, 138630, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice sky but the processing does not do it justice; the image is flat.  The main subject is soft and there are artifacts around its edges - not sure what happened here.</td>', 'Looks like a nice sky but the processing does not do it justice; the image is flat.  The main subject is soft and there are artifacts around its edges - not sure what happened here.', '2012-05-27 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779440, 1016154, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast and texture, so that hits the mark. Nice one.</td>', 'Wonderful contrast and texture, so that hits the mark. Nice one.', '2012-05-27 18:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779441, 1016444, 138630, '<td valign="top">The pink tones were eye-catching in this challenge that ended up being almost exclusively black and white.  Other than that, the image does not interest me.</td>', 'The pink tones were eye-catching in this challenge that ended up being almost exclusively black and white.  Other than that, the image does not interest me.', '2012-05-27 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779442, 1016245, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very well spotted and executed. I have minor quibbles about the crop but the contrast is spot on and the scene is textbook.</td>', 'Very well spotted and executed. I have minor quibbles about the crop but the contrast is spot on and the scene is textbook.', '2012-05-27 18:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779443, 1016411, 138630, '<td valign="top">The highlights are blown and the focus is off.  I do think the subject had potential for the challenge.</td>', 'The highlights are blown and the focus is off.  I do think the subject had potential for the challenge.', '2012-05-27 18:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779444, 1016359, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Lovely tonal range. Well spotted composition. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Very nice. Lovely tonal range. Well spotted composition. Excellent photo.', '2012-05-27 18:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779446, 1016492, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is a perspective that can be very effective, but for me it is not, here.  Maybe that''s because the focus is too soft, perhaps another tree would have given you more opportunity to show a nice range of tones in the branches.  The patterns and textures of the bark across the mid-section are nice . . .</td>', 'This is a perspective that can be very effective, but for me it is not, here.  Maybe that''s because the focus is too soft, perhaps another tree would have given you more opportunity to show a nice range of tones in the branches.  The patterns and textures of the bark across the mid-section are nice . . .', '2012-05-27 18:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779448, 1016125, 108069, '<td valign="top">The right amount of contrast and tonal range, dodged and burned just so. May as well be his. Very well done.</td>', 'The right amount of contrast and tonal range, dodged and burned just so. May as well be his. Very well done.', '2012-05-27 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779450, 1016419, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Contrast and crisp detail is spot on. Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely image. Contrast and crisp detail is spot on. Nice take on the challenge.', '2012-05-27 18:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779451, 1016351, 108069, '<td valign="top">High contrast and crisp detail is on the mark. Nice take.</td>', 'High contrast and crisp detail is on the mark. Nice take.', '2012-05-27 18:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779452, 1015987, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great detail and contrast in the sand and grass, but to be honest I''m finding the blurred clouds a bit distracting. Not voting, just whining.</td>', 'Great detail and contrast in the sand and grass, but to be honest I''m finding the blurred clouds a bit distracting. Not voting, just whining.', '2012-05-27 18:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779453, 1015949, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great contrast. Nice light and detail. What the doctor ordered.</td>', 'Great contrast. Nice light and detail. What the doctor ordered.', '2012-05-27 18:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779454, 1016541, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great idea and potential, but the composition could use some work, including making better use of the wonderful texture in the tree trunk and leveling the horizon. Well seen and excellent potential.</td>', 'Great idea and potential, but the composition could use some work, including making better use of the wonderful texture in the tree trunk and leveling the horizon. Well seen and excellent potential.', '2012-05-27 18:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779455, 1016154, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the nearest parts of the lily but the shadows on the petals are too pronounced, I think, and the farther petals and especially grain of the wood lack definition.</td>', 'Nice focus on the nearest parts of the lily but the shadows on the petals are too pronounced, I think, and the farther petals and especially grain of the wood lack definition.', '2012-05-27 18:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779457, 1016536, 138630, '<td valign="top">This wood is very nice but for me the shadows on the lily are much too dark.</td>', 'This wood is very nice but for me the shadows on the lily are much too dark.', '2012-05-27 18:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779458, 1016430, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, beautiful photo.</td>', 'Great contrast, beautiful photo.', '2012-05-27 18:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779460, 1016279, 108069, '<td valign="top">Perfect detail, crispness, high local contrast, tonal range, exposure management. Basically an Ansel Adams photograph. Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Perfect detail, crispness, high local contrast, tonal range, exposure management. Basically an Ansel Adams photograph. Excellent stuff.', '2012-05-27 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779461, 1016492, 108069, '<td valign="top">Shallow depth of field was not really his thing, but it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'Shallow depth of field was not really his thing, but it''s a nice shot.', '2012-05-27 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779462, 1016087, 138630, '<td valign="top">Keep coming back to this one - I don''t know what to make of it, esp in terms of the challenge, but I do like it.</td>', 'Keep coming back to this one - I don''t know what to make of it, esp in terms of the challenge, but I do like it.', '2012-05-27 18:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779463, 1016405, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great stuff. Nice detail, depth, contrast, tonal range. Well done.</td>', 'Great stuff. Nice detail, depth, contrast, tonal range. Well done.', '2012-05-27 18:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779468, 1016496, 138630, '<td valign="top">The subject is excellent for the challenge, but for me the image falls short in composition (the almost 50-50 horizontal balance feels static), tonal range (highlights are blown), and focus (sky is too soft).  Voted earlier</td>', 'The subject is excellent for the challenge, but for me the image falls short in composition (the almost 50-50 horizontal balance feels static), tonal range (highlights are blown), and focus (sky is too soft).  Voted earlier', '2012-05-27 18:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779470, 1016015, 138630, '<td valign="top">The diagonal line of the swan grouping is very nice but the focus is soft and I really wish at least some of them were more interested/interesting :)</td>', 'The diagonal line of the swan grouping is very nice but the focus is soft and I really wish at least some of them were more interested/interesting :)', '2012-05-27 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779471, 1016578, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, contrast and detail, so it''s right on target. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Lovely light, contrast and detail, so it''s right on target. Very nice photo.', '2012-05-27 18:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779472, 1016361, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent local contrast, detail and light. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent local contrast, detail and light. Very well done.', '2012-05-27 18:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779483, 1015740, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like the transitions and lines where the type of vegetation changes.  Compared to what I think of as Ansel Adams style this has rather limited tones, with large areas in the mid-tonal range, and very little detail in the shadows.  The sky adds a bit of interest, though.</td>', 'I like the transitions and lines where the type of vegetation changes.  Compared to what I think of as Ansel Adams style this has rather limited tones, with large areas in the mid-tonal range, and very little detail in the shadows.  The sky adds a bit of interest, though.', '2012-05-27 19:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779484, 1016541, 3936, '<td valign="top">This image definitely reminds me of Ansel Adams.  My only issue is the horizon seems off balance, with the left side being lower than the right.  9 from me.</td>', 'This image definitely reminds me of Ansel Adams.  My only issue is the horizon seems off balance, with the left side being lower than the right.  9 from me.', '2012-05-27 19:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779485, 1016361, 128323, '<td valign="top">Very nice processing and composition!  I love that moody sky!  (voted earlier)<br/> <br/>Back to bump--this is awesome!</td>', 'Very nice processing and composition!  I love that moody sky!  (voted earlier) Back to bump--this is awesome!', '2012-05-27 19:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779486, 1016279, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!  This looks like a hahn23 shot.  Front-page material.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'This is amazing!  This looks like a hahn23 shot.  Front-page material.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-27 19:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779487, 1016359, 128323, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  It''s an unusual horizon location, but it works nicely with the water reflecting the sky.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Beautiful!  It''s an unusual horizon location, but it works nicely with the water reflecting the sky.  (voted earlier)', '2012-05-27 19:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779488, 1016438, 3936, '<td valign="top">Extra points for knowing that Adams did more than mountains and dark skies.  And a darned nice portrait...</td>', 'Extra points for knowing that Adams did more than mountains and dark skies.  And a darned nice portrait...', '2012-05-27 19:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779490, 1016420, 3936, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth of field for this image.  The halo along the ridge detracts a little bit.  A little burning in here would help. 8</td>', 'Excellent depth of field for this image.  The halo along the ridge detracts a little bit.  A little burning in here would help. 8', '2012-05-27 19:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779491, 1016504, 3936, '<td valign="top">Oh, very nice.  The Aspens are fantastic.  Beautifully sharp mountains.  Wow!</td>', 'Oh, very nice.  The Aspens are fantastic.  Beautifully sharp mountains.  Wow!', '2012-05-27 19:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779492, 1016300, 3936, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the rays of light.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the rays of light.', '2012-05-27 19:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779494, 1016347, 3936, '<td valign="top">I find myself wishing for some detail in the sky.  The river and the rocks are very well done.</td>', 'I find myself wishing for some detail in the sky.  The river and the rocks are very well done.', '2012-05-27 20:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779495, 1016228, 3936, '<td valign="top">I love the shadings of the light in the sky.</td>', 'I love the shadings of the light in the sky.', '2012-05-27 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779496, 1015546, 108069, '<td valign="top">When I think of Ansel I think of localized high contrast, crispness, and an extensive tonal range, and this nails it on all fronts. It''s a stunning photo in its own right, and ideal for this challenge. Well done.</td>', 'When I think of Ansel I think of localized high contrast, crispness, and an extensive tonal range, and this nails it on all fronts. It''s a stunning photo in its own right, and ideal for this challenge. Well done.', '2012-05-27 20:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779497, 1016494, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful art. I''d argue it''s not the endless clarity that Ansel sought, <strike>but I''m not voting</strike> and it''s simply beautiful, so that''s enough for me.<br/> <br/>I upped my membership so I''m now voting. 8 for alliteration with art.</td>', 'Wonderful art. I''d argue it''s not the endless clarity that Ansel sought, but I''m not voting and it''s simply beautiful, so that''s enough for me. I upped my membership so I''m now voting. 8 for alliteration with art.', '2012-05-27 20:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779498, 1016263, 3936, '<td valign="top">I believe that barn looked like that, when I was there 33 years ago.  Love this image.</td>', 'I believe that barn looked like that, when I was there 33 years ago.  Love this image.', '2012-05-27 20:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779499, 1016246, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great tones and dreamy image. Certainly not the depth or clarity Ansel would seek, but it''s quite nice.</td>', 'Great tones and dreamy image. Certainly not the depth or clarity Ansel would seek, but it''s quite nice.', '2012-05-27 20:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779500, 1016369, 3936, '<td valign="top">This belongs in a gallery.</td>', 'This belongs in a gallery.', '2012-05-27 20:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779501, 1016299, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast, but the contrast doesn''t aid the detail. If I had taken such a nice shot I''d have cropped it from the left a bit to get rid of the distracting leaves creeping in, but I haven''t taken such a nice shot so I should probably keep my trap shut.</td>', 'Nice high contrast, but the contrast doesn''t aid the detail. If I had taken such a nice shot I''d have cropped it from the left a bit to get rid of the distracting leaves creeping in, but I haven''t taken such a nice shot so I should probably keep my trap shut.', '2012-05-27 20:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779502, 1016246, 3936, '<td valign="top">Infrared?  Image seems a little dark overall.  But very nice idea.</td>', 'Infrared?  Image seems a little dark overall.  But very nice idea.', '2012-05-27 20:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779503, 1016166, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, detail and contrast, so just as it should be. Well spotted and very well done.</td>', 'Lovely light, detail and contrast, so just as it should be. Well spotted and very well done.', '2012-05-27 20:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779504, 1016348, 3936, '<td valign="top">I''m torn between liking the tree as a frame, and wishing it wasn''t there, because I really like the shapes and the shades of the mountains in the background.</td>', 'I''m torn between liking the tree as a frame, and wishing it wasn''t there, because I really like the shapes and the shades of the mountains in the background.', '2012-05-27 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779506, 1015987, 3936, '<td valign="top">Clouds are a little too processed for me.  I like the texture of the sand and the grass.</td>', 'Clouds are a little too processed for me.  I like the texture of the sand and the grass.', '2012-05-27 20:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779509, 1016385, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great sky. Nice contrast and detail. Well done.</td>', 'Great sky. Nice contrast and detail. Well done.', '2012-05-27 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779511, 1015546, 3936, '<td valign="top">My pick for the blue.  10!</td>', 'My pick for the blue.  10!', '2012-05-27 20:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779518, 1016580, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and "atmosphere". On my monitor it''s lacking details in the shadows which I think of being one of the hallmark''s of an Ansel Adams photo.</td>', 'Nice lines and "atmosphere". On my monitor it''s lacking details in the shadows which I think of being one of the hallmark''s of an Ansel Adams photo.', '2012-05-27 20:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779520, 1016543, 104230, '<td valign="top">On my monitor it''s lacking details in the shadows which I think of being one of the hallmark''s of an Ansel Adams photo. But I''m enjoying the composition and the "message".</td>', 'On my monitor it''s lacking details in the shadows which I think of being one of the hallmark''s of an Ansel Adams photo. But I''m enjoying the composition and the "message".', '2012-05-27 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779538, 1016561, 104230, '<td valign="top">Clever idea!  Some very nice tones here</td>', 'Clever idea!  Some very nice tones here', '2012-05-27 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779543, 1016488, 104230, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the light in this image is quite flat.  On my monitor there are no details in the dark areas, and both the mid-tones and lightest areas are rather dull looking. Not what I would expect to see in an Ansel Adams'' photo IMO.  There is something very majestic about the way this gull is standing though.</td>', 'Unfortunately the light in this image is quite flat.  On my monitor there are no details in the dark areas, and both the mid-tones and lightest areas are rather dull looking. Not what I would expect to see in an Ansel Adams'' photo IMO.  There is something very majestic about the way this gull is standing though.', '2012-05-27 22:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779544, 1016452, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, lines, and details in this architectural shot.</td>', 'Nice tones, lines, and details in this architectural shot.', '2012-05-27 22:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779577, 1016485, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting looking fortification and tree, but IMO the processing is not strongly in the Ansel Adams style (apart from being in B&amp;W) and the details lack clarity.</td>', 'Interesting looking fortification and tree, but IMO the processing is not strongly in the Ansel Adams style (apart from being in B&W) and the details lack clarity.', '2012-05-27 23:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779578, 1016227, 104230, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene but the image appears almost like an etching and looks over-sharpened. The shapes of the buildings is its strongest point, a closer view of them might have made for a stronger image, but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'An interesting scene but the image appears almost like an etching and looks over-sharpened. The shapes of the buildings is its strongest point, a closer view of them might have made for a stronger image, but that is just my opinion.', '2012-05-27 23:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779606, 1016566, 114285, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, I probably would of darkened the sky more like Ansel did, still great scene, already voted.</td>', 'Nice scene, I probably would of darkened the sky more like Ansel did, still great scene, already voted.', '2012-05-28 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779611, 1016348, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, shapes and textures</td>', 'Lovely light, shapes and textures', '2012-05-28 00:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6779613, 1016420, 104230, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene with the mixture of animals. I find the light rather <strike>flat</strike> uniform (as others said it''s more harsh than flat, I was using that term to mean without much variation, and that is not correct usage) and the image lacking the balance of tonal values that Ansel Adams was known for. But a good subject choice for a Black and White image. I like this more coming back a second time and have bumped it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-05-29 13:18:32.</i></td>', 'An interesting scene with the mixture of animals. I find the light rather flat uniform (as others said it''s more harsh than flat, I was using that term to mean without much variation, and that is not correct usage) and the image lacking the balance of tonal values that Ansel Adams was known for. But a good subject choice for a Black and White image. I like this more coming back a second time and have bumped it.', '2012-05-28 00:56:22.000000', '2012-05-29 14:18:32.000000', 1),
(6779615, 1016406, 104230, '<td valign="top">Fun, but my reaction is that I wish it had been shot with greater depth of field.</td>', 'Fun, but my reaction is that I wish it had been shot with greater depth of field.', '2012-05-28 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
