(6779737, 1016369, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats Dennis with a great image. Reading your write up I can relate and appreciate that had conditions been better... It could easily have been another story...<br/>But let''s not forget... There''s no such thing as bad weather.:) Great job and this image unique on its own.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-05-28 02:01:07.</i></td>', 'Congrats Dennis with a great image. Reading your write up I can relate and appreciate that had conditions been better... It could easily have been another story...But let''s not forget... There''s no such thing as bad weather.:) Great job and this image unique on its own.', '2012-05-28 03:00:13.000000', '2012-05-28 03:01:07.000000', 0),
