(6779767, 1016109, 40391, '<td valign="top">You''re right, this did deserve more comments during voting. I had a similar entry that also only got two comments but it was no where near as good, which is reflected in my score.  I felt this met the challenge really well and was nicely edited. I gave it a seven but was one of my earlier photos to judge and may even have scored it higher compared to the rest. Or at least after studying it more like I have now.  Well done!</td>', 'You''re right, this did deserve more comments during voting. I had a similar entry that also only got two comments but it was no where near as good, which is reflected in my score.  I felt this met the challenge really well and was nicely edited. I gave it a seven but was one of my earlier photos to judge and may even have scored it higher compared to the rest. Or at least after studying it more like I have now.  Well done!', '2012-05-28 04:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
