(6780488, 1016485, 143844, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MrJear:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats. This is a very dificult shot. El Morro is beautiful and a very relaxing place. Keep it up. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Jear, I had difficults with the minimum resolution on this one, don''t know what happened! to much pixelation. =)<br/> <br/>thanks for the comments, and yes el Morro is beautiful...! and all Puerto Rico!!  (Sadly not the administration!!)  <br/> <br/>Keep Shooting!!</td>', 'Originally posted by MrJear: Congrats. This is a very dificult shot. El Morro is beautiful and a very relaxing place. Keep it up.   Thanks Jear, I had difficults with the minimum resolution on this one, don''t know what happened! to much pixelation. =) thanks for the comments, and yes el Morro is beautiful...! and all Puerto Rico!!  (Sadly not the administration!!)   Keep Shooting!!', '2012-05-29 10:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
